    # MC "I've known Miya's daughters almost my whole life, it's not like they vanished whenever Miya babysat me. So Noelle is no exception."
    MC "我几乎认识米娅的女儿们一辈子了，她们并没有因为米娅照顾我而消失。所以诺艾尔也不例外。"

