    # MC "She didn't do well in school, exactly..."
    MC "她在学校成绩不太好……"

# game/script.rpyc:830
translate schinese main1_834dfd54:

    # MC "Don't take it the wrong way, though. Her common sense is normal. And she takes great care of me."
    MC "不过别误会。她很懂常识，而且很照顾我。"

