    # MC "Miya's second daughter."
    MC "米娅的二女儿。"

# game/script.rpyc:858
translate schinese main1_f85ff19e:

    # MC "Grace is my best friend."
    MC "格蕾丝是我最好的朋友。"

# game/script.rpyc:859
translate schinese main1_f79afc0b:

    # MC "Pretty simple. People throw around terms like \"We do everything together\" when talking about their best friends."
    MC "很简单。人们谈到最好的朋友时，常说“我们什么都一起做”。"

# game/script.rpyc:860
translate schinese main1_7b5cbb01:

    # MC "As children we really {i}did{/i} do everything together. She used to cry when it was time for me to go back home."
    MC "小时候我们确实{i}真的{/i}什么都一起做。每次我要回家时，她都会哭。"

# game/script.rpyc:861
translate schinese main1_28556c08:

    # MC "She's still in school, and doing pretty well, actually. She's smart. I think she's in contention for a chemistry scholarship."
    MC "她现在还在上学，而且成绩相当不错。她很聪明，我觉得她在争夺一份化学奖学金。"

# game/script.rpyc:862
translate schinese main1_ed482057:

    # MC "She's also {i}crazy{/i} fit."
    MC "她还{i}疯狂{/i}地健身。"

# game/script.rpyc:863
translate schinese main1_6c10a29f:

    # MC "She's always exercising, and a member of the school's swim team."
    MC "她总是锻炼，还是学校游泳队的成员。"

# game/script.rpyc:864
translate schinese main1_ac527d81:

    # MC "Unlike me, I have no interest in sport. Strange, considering how much we have in common."
    MC "不像，我对运动毫无兴趣。考虑到我们共同点这么多，这很奇怪。"

# game/script.rpyc:865
translate schinese main1_0fa417bb:

    # MC "It's insane, she had abs at eleven. I haven't seen her swim, but I've seen her running, and got my ass kicked in sparring matches."
    MC "她十一岁就有腹肌了，真是离谱。我没见过她游泳，但见过她跑步，还在切磋中被她打得屁滚尿流。"

# game/script.rpyc:866
translate schinese main1_b6dccbaf:

    # MC "There's something... unnatural about it if I'm being perfectly transparent..."
    MC "如果我完全坦白地说……这多少有点……不太自然……"

