translate schinese main1_ef5edabf:

    # MC "Well, I used to be as close to her as any of the other girls, but that's when she was little. As she grew older, she started quietening up..."
    MC "以前我和她和其他女孩一样亲近，但那是她还小的时候。她长大以后，就慢慢变得安静了……"

