    MC "他为什么看起来这么……"

# game/script.rpyc:5564
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_bf1e9e83:

    # MC "Devoid of personality?"
    MC "毫无个性？"

# game/script.rpyc:5565
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_e314f45e:

    # MC "You can't even see his face..."
    MC "你甚至看不到他的脸……"

# game/script.rpyc:5569
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_7a42c522:

    # c "It's not too uncommon for protagonists to be like that."
    c "主角这样并不少见。"

# game/script.rpyc:5573
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_06574462:

    # c "There are multiple reasons a developer might do this."
    c "开发者这么做可能有很多原因。"

# game/script.rpyc:5577
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_c2059bba:

    # c "The most common one is that the more average and unexceptional you make the protagonist, the less alienating it is for each player."
    c "最常见的是，你把主角设定得越普通、越没有特点，玩家就越不会觉得自己被排斥。"

# game/script.rpyc:5581
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_519c96fd:

    # c "So they attempt to make them as unassuming as possible."
    c "所以他们会尽量让主角显得平平无奇。"

# game/script.rpyc:5585
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_6d0b1051:

    # c "Nothing interesting about them whatsoever."
    c "完全没有任何有趣的地方。"

# game/script.rpyc:5586
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_c68c452b:

    # MC "B-but... they could at least give them a face, right? Make them interesting?"
    MC "可、可是……他们至少可以给他一张脸吧？让他有点意思？"

# game/script.rpyc:5587
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_2f22ab72:

    # c "Hmm... If I were to guess, that's probably more of a symptom than a feature."
    c "嗯……如果我猜，这更多是症状而不是特色。"

# game/script.rpyc:5588
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_cc7053b8:

    # MC "A symptom of what?"
    MC "什么症状？"

# game/script.rpyc:5590
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_afdced91:

    # c "The developers' lack of confidence that they could create a compelling main character."
    c "开发者没有信心创造出一个有魅力的主角。"

# game/script.rpyc:5591
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_f18e8c38:

    # c "\"Let's just put this guy in so the story can revolve around him.\""
    c "“就把这家伙放进去，让故事围绕他展开吧。”"

# game/script.rpyc:5592
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_99c4c485:

    # c "\"Surely the players don't need to invest in him...\""
    c "“玩家肯定不需要对他投入感情……”"

# game/script.rpyc:5593
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_218a928b:

    # c "At least that's what they tell themselves."
    c "至少他们是这么告诉自己的。"

# game/script.rpyc:5594
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_50053ce7:

    # c "But the truth is that the writers don't know what to do with them."
    c "但事实是，编剧不知道该拿主角怎么办。"

# game/script.rpyc:5595
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_fc38b8d1:

    # c "Which means no interesting personality traits,"
    c "所以他没有有趣的性格特点，"

# game/script.rpyc:5596
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_eeb4a1b6:

    # c "No eye-catching character design,"
    c "没有吸引人的角色设计，"

# game/script.rpyc:5597
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_0ca295e6:

    # c "And usually, no character development."
    c "通常也没有角色成长。"

# game/script.rpyc:5601
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_140eea5e:

    # c "How can you develop a self-insert character, right?"
    c "毕竟要怎么让一个自我代入角色成长，对吧？"

# game/script.rpyc:5602
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_41d7ad65:

    # c "Do you expect the player to develop with them?"
    c "难道要期待玩家和他一起成长？"

# game/script.rpyc:5606
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_6be1edca:

    # c "So you ignore the protagonist. Surely the plot and other characters will fill the void."
    c "于是他们干脆无视主角，想着剧情和其他角色会填补空白。"

# game/script.rpyc:5607
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_09528393:

    # c "It's possible you'll regret it later, though, but it's too late now isn't it?"
    c "你以后可能会后悔，不过现在也太晚了，对吧？"

# game/script.rpyc:5611
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_9f8ea969:

    # c "You've already made the renders, put months of work into the game with the protagonist as he is."
    c "你都已经做好渲染图，把现在的这个主角写进游戏里，花了好几个月。"

# game/script.rpyc:5612
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_423b06ee:

    # c "If you were to make the effort to inject some personality into the main guy, it isn't just recreating the renders, but you may feel inclined to rewrite some of the story."
    c "如果你真要费心给主角注入一些个性，就不只是重做渲染图了，你可能还会想重写部分剧情。"

# game/script.rpyc:5613
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_37ccd2f1:

    # c "You are of course, overhauling the guy at the center of your game."
    c "毕竟你是在彻底改造游戏的核心角色。"

# game/script.rpyc:5624
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_7543ea61:

    # c "Huh?"
    c "嗯？"

# game/script.rpyc:5634
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_d19f855d:

    # c "..."
    c "……"

# game/script.rpyc:5635
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_1d1307f4:

    # c "I'm restarting..."
    c "我重新开始……"

# game/script.rpyc:5661
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_0303efc6:

    # c "C'mon... fight back."
    c "来……反击啊。"

# game/script.rpyc:5662
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_da3181fe:

    # MC "I'm having an existential crisis over here."
    MC "我这边正在经历一场存在主义危机。"

# game/script.rpyc:5663
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_513f9824:

    # c "Well can you fast forward through it? {i}You{/i} were the one who suggested we play."
    c "那你能快进过去吗？明明是你{i}提议{/i}玩的。"

# game/script.rpyc:5664
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_438e3446:

    # MC "Fine."
    MC "很好。"

# game/script.rpyc:5734
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_d19f855d_1:

    # c "..."
    c "……"

# game/script.rpyc:5735
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_72deaca9:

    # c "You're kidding right?"
    c "开玩笑吧？"

# game/script.rpyc:5739
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_cd06bb40:

    # c "One more!"
    c "来一次！"

# game/script.rpyc:5756
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_64a9c806:

    # c "What the fuck, man?! How did you learn so fast?"
    c "什么鬼？！你怎么学得这么快？"

# game/script.rpyc:5757
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_a05a3137:

    # MC "Told you I was talented."
    MC "就跟你说过我有天赋了。"

# game/script.rpyc:5761
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_7889359c:

    # c "No no no! This is insane!"
    c "不不！这太离谱了！"

# game/script.rpyc:5762
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_c245f99b:

    # c "You should be doing e-sports or something!"
    c "应该去搞电竞什么的！"

# game/script.rpyc:5763
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_ab11944b:

    # MC "E-sports?"
    MC "电竞？"

# game/script.rpyc:5767
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_81635f8e:

    # MC "Nah..."
    MC "算了吧……"

# game/script.rpyc:5771
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_a1967be3:

    # c "Why not?!"
    c "什么不呢？！"

# game/script.rpyc:5772
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_f739aada:

    # MC "\"Why\"?"
    MC "“为什么”？"

# game/script.rpyc:5773
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_d420dde2:

    # MC "I just... don't really enjoy fighting games that much..."
    MC "我只是……不太喜欢格斗游戏……"

# game/script.rpyc:5782
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_60e6443b:

    # c "Kinda pisses me off..."
    c "玩起来挺让人火大的……"

# game/script.rpyc:5783
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_19570c32:

    # MC "What?"
    MC "什么？"

# game/script.rpyc:5787
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_d65c9868:

    # c "I said it kinda pisses me off."
    c "我说，那玩意儿挺让人火大的。"

# game/script.rpyc:5788
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_ae3e3c12:

    # c "You're good enough to be a pro at fighting games but you won't because you don't feel like it."
    c "你的格斗游戏水平完全够得上职业选手，却因为没兴趣而不去打。"

# game/script.rpyc:5792
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_3e669aa8:

    # c "You got good grades without even trying."
    c "你根本不用怎么努力就能拿高分。"

# game/script.rpyc:5793
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_e4edbed8:

    # c "Then you did nothing with them!"
    c "结果却把这些成绩白白浪费了！"

# game/script.rpyc:5797
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_454a2953:

    # c "Grace says you're strong."
    c "格蕾丝说你很强。"

# game/script.rpyc:5798
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_fa0e74e4:

    # c "But you don't even work out!"
    c "可你明明连健身都不做！"

# game/script.rpyc:5811
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_17a3e860:

    # c "You're good with computers!"
    c "你电脑方面也很强！"

# game/script.rpyc:5812
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_4ce8503a:

    # c "You can talk to strangers without any anxiety!"
    c "你能毫无焦虑地和陌生人交谈了！"

# game/script.rpyc:5813
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_6130057f:

    # c "You're good at singing even when you don't practice!"
    c "你就算不练习，歌也唱得很好听啊！"

# game/script.rpyc:5817
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_d7ea31c6:

    # c "You're the only one here with magic and you don't even use it!"
    c "你是这里唯一有魔法的人，却连用都不用！"

# game/script.rpyc:5831
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_d19f855d_2:

    # c "..."
    c "……"

# game/script.rpyc:5836
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_bc30dece:

    # c "Sorry."
    c "抱歉。"

# game/script.rpyc:5841
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_0e6d003f:

    # MC "You didn't know?"
    MC "你不知道吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:5845
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_7292cddd:

    # MC "I'm going to college to study magic."
    MC "我要去上大学学魔法了。"

# game/script.rpyc:5853
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_05b662dc:

    # c "Took you long enough."
    c "你可真够慢的。"

# game/script.rpyc:5854
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_e21f6933:

    # MC "To go to college?"
    MC "去上大学？"

# game/script.rpyc:5855
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_1fcfac52:

    # c "All the talent funneled into you and Grace. It's about time you stopped wasting it."
    c "所有的天赋都集中在了你和格蕾丝身上。你早该停止浪费时间了。"

# game/script.rpyc:5856
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_bad4df51:

    # c "You'll be good at it."
    c "你会擅长这个的。"

# game/script.rpyc:5857
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_6f4a2338:

    # MC "Thanks."
    MC "谢谢。"

# game/script.rpyc:5858
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_8569d08a:

    # c "Are you moving out?"
    c "你要搬走吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:5859
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_c4b96180:

    # MC "Probably not. I'm only going to Rockwell."
    MC "大概不会。我只是去罗克韦尔（Rockwell）。"

# game/script.rpyc:5860
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_d19f855d_3:

    # c "..."
    c "……"

# game/script.rpyc:5870
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_aff9a969:

    # c "I'm putting on cheats."
    c "我要开作弊码了。"

# game/script.rpyc:5871
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_364df852:

    # MC "So you can beat me?"
    MC "好让你能赢我？"

# game/script.rpyc:5872
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_c0334108:

    # c "Yep."
    c "对。"

# game/script.rpyc:5877
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_2e1a64aa:

    # MC "That's the most animated I've seen you in years."
    MC "这可是我这几年来见过的你最有活力的一面。"

# game/script.rpyc:5881
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_5d1f62c9_1:

    # c "Shut up."
    c "闭嘴。"

# game/script.rpyc:5882
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_0e76b468:

    # MC "Where did your usual grogginess go?"
    MC "你平时那副昏昏沉沉的样子去哪儿了？"

# game/script.rpyc:5883
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_2c52d204:

    # MC "You know it's already past your bedtime."
    MC "你知道早就过了你的睡觉时间了吧。"

# game/script.rpyc:5884
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_9afeef9d:

    # c "I said shut up."
    c "我叫你闭嘴。"

# game/script.rpyc:5900
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_2a2a0dd3:

    # c "Heh! How's that?!"
    c "嘿！怎么样？！"

# game/script.rpyc:5901
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_9f6d5345:

    # MC "Isn't this victory unsatisfying when the odds are stacked so highly in your favor?"
    MC "胜算这么大，赢了也没什么成就感吧？"

# game/script.rpyc:5902
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_0e93dd95:

    # c "You're already cheating at life with your \"talents\". So I think it evens out."
    c "你靠着你的“天赋”在生活中就已经在作弊了，所以我觉着这算是扯平了。"

# game/script.rpyc:5915
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_381cde56:

    # MC "Oh, wow! A chainsaw! What a fun, competitive match we're having."
    MC "哇哦！电锯！咱们这场比赛可真是既有趣又充满竞争性啊。"

# game/script.rpyc:5920
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_6993a4be:

    # MCt "Yeah... she's gone a bit too far with these cheats."
    MCt "是啊……她用这些作弊手段确实有点过分了。"

# game/script.rpyc:5921
translate schinese m5afterchoice1_220a82ec:

    # MCt "I think I'm going to have to play dirty..."
    MCt "看来我也得来点阴招了……"

