    c "看来你再也赢不了我了。"

# game/script.rpyc:6007
translate schinese m5choice2_4_ebdf7ff0:

    # MC "I'll have the last laugh once you realize that nothing can beat the satisfaction of defeating me with cheats enabled."
    MC "等你意识到“开挂击败我”的快感是无与伦比的时候，笑到最后的肯定是我。"

# game/script.rpyc:6008
translate schinese m5choice2_4_4d5a3121:

    # MC "Congratulations."
    MC "恭喜。"

# game/script.rpyc:6010
translate schinese m5choice2_4_51e1e384:

    # c "Whatever, I'll savor it anyway."
    c "随你怎么说，反正我会好好享受这一刻的。"

