    MCt "虽然很晚了……但至少她已经睡着了……"

# game/script.rpyc:6026
translate schinese m5afterchoice2_897c27ad:

    # MCt "I don't think I've bonded with Chloe like that for years."
    MCt "我已经好多年没和克洛伊这么亲密地相处过了。"

# game/script.rpyc:6027
translate schinese m5afterchoice2_27af7f30:

    # MCt "She used to be really clingy when she was a kid."
    MCt "她小时候特别黏人。"

# game/script.rpyc:6029
translate schinese m5afterchoice2_aee15547:

    # MCt "I better not fall out of a sleeping schedule either. I {i}really{/i} don't wanna miss my meeting with Dr. Bashford."
    MCt "我也得注意别打乱了作息规律。我{i}真的{/i}不想错过和巴什福德博士的会面。"

# game/script.rpyc:6032
translate schinese m5afterchoice2_976f148e:

    # MCt "I need to find out what the hell this magic is all about."
    MCt "我得弄清楚这魔法到底是怎么回事。"

