translate schinese m10afterchoice1_aac2ea5d:

    # C "Umm... okay. I'll be in the hall."
    C "嗯……好的。我在大厅等你们。"

# game/script.rpyc:12905
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_7f208eaa:

    # MC "Hmm?"
    MC "嗯？"

# game/script.rpyc:12909
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_401c3c18:

    # s "Umm... Why exactly am {i}I{/i} needed? I don't mind helping, but is four people really not enough?"
    s "嗯……到底为什么要叫上我？我倒是不介意帮忙，但四个人真的不够吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:12910
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_27fa4a18:

    # MC "Stella, I actually chose you for two reasons."
    MC "斯特拉，其实我选你有两个理由。"

# game/script.rpyc:12911
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_73cf5d1e:

    # MC "Cadence is putting on a smile, but she's shaken up whether she's trying to hide it or not."
    MC "凯登丝虽然脸上挂着微笑，但无论她如何掩饰，内心其实都深受震动。"

# game/script.rpyc:12912
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_417c1055:

    # MC "As a fellow slave you were the best person I could choose in terms of relating to her. You can't relate to her past, but you can relate to her future."
    MC "作为同样身为奴隶的人，你是最能与她产生共鸣的人选。你或许无法感同身受她的过去，但你能理解她的未来。"

# game/script.rpyc:12913
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_e75eea4f:

    # MC "Ronald doesn't mistreat you in any way as far as I know. Your existence alone can act as a form of reassurance for her. Ease her, tell her anecdotes."
    MC "据我所知，罗纳德并没有亏待过你。光是你的存在，就能给她带来一种安心感。安抚她，跟她讲讲趣事。"

# game/script.rpyc:12914
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_70f56981:

    # MC "I want her to feel as safe as possible."
    MC "我希望她能感到尽可能多的安全感。"

# game/script.rpyc:12915
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_1f4ad17d:

    # s "What's the second reason?"
    s "那第二个理由呢？"

# game/script.rpyc:12916
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_7e242913:

    # MC "Magic stuff."
    MC "关于魔法的事。"

# game/script.rpyc:12917
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_d87f03b0:

    # MC "You know more about it than I do. And some weird-ass magic was involved in the whole situation."
    MC "你比我更懂行。而且整件事里涉及了一些相当诡异的魔法。"

# game/script.rpyc:12918
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_a959652e:

    # MC "Not saying you'll get the answers, just that you can ask the most serviceable questions."
    MC "我不是说你一定能找到答案，只是你能提出最切中要害的问题。"

# game/script.rpyc:12919
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_e1554201:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

# game/script.rpyc:12920
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_e9dad546:

    # s "I understand. I'll see what I can do."
    s "我明白了。我会看看能做些什么。"

# game/script.rpyc:12930
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_2f08e88e:

    # MC "So what needs to be done, exactly."
    MC "那么，具体需要做什么呢？"

# game/script.rpyc:12934
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_041fa35f:

    # m "As far as the house goes, I can't think of much. I can look over this room to make sure that everything is in working order."
    m "关于房子，我暂时想不到有什么特别要做的。我可以检查一下这个房间，确保一切设施都能正常使用。"

# game/script.rpyc:12935
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_31a4762f:

    # m "Power sockets are working, spare sheets in the drawers, everything is tidy..."
    m "电源插座没问题，抽屉里有备用床单，一切都很整洁……"

# game/script.rpyc:12939
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_25ca705f:

    # n "She needs clothes."
    n "她需要衣服。"

# game/script.rpyc:12940
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_ee5112e4:

    # n "As soon as possible preferably."
    n "最好是尽快。"

# game/script.rpyc:12944
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_a0e92d1f:

    # n "Hehe, nothing sparks joy quite like the rare opportunity to go clothes shopping for someone else!"
    n "嘿嘿，能有机会给别人买衣服，这可是件让人特别开心的事！"

# game/script.rpyc:12945
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_544d23f9:

    # n "I've got too many ideas! Cadence has such a nice body, she'll look good in almost anything."
    n "我脑子里已经有一堆点子了！凯登丝身材那么好，穿什么应该都好看。"

# game/script.rpyc:12949
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_5af417c3:

    # n "You're coming too."
    n "你也得一起去。"

# game/script.rpyc:12953
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_b541f034:

    # c "Eh?! What?! Why?!"
    c "诶？！什么？！为什么？！"

# game/script.rpyc:12956
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_2d35ccaa:

    # n "Because you're ugly!"
    n "因为你很丑！"

# game/script.rpyc:12957
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_1b79677d:

    # c "UGLY?!"
    c "丑？！"

# game/script.rpyc:12959
translate schinese m10afterchoice1_f0f1bdd6:

    # n "That's right! You're ugly! And I'm done not saying anything about it."
    n "没错！你就是丑！我受够了对此保持沉默。"

# game/script.rpyc:12967
translate schinese m10choice2_1_35b2105b:

    # n "Bare, unexpressive face with no makeup."
    n "素面朝天，毫无表情。"

# game/script.rpyc:12971
translate schinese m10choice2_1_7ae5fd3a:

    # n "Messy, unkempt hair that makes you look statically charged."
    n "头发乱蓬蓬的，看起来像带了静电一样。"

# game/script.rpyc:12975
translate schinese m10choice2_1_1abbff50:

    # n "Bland wardrobe with no personality or any way of complementing your slim figure."
    n "毫无个性的平廡穿搭，完全托期不出你苗条的身材。"

# game/script.rpyc:12988
translate schinese m10choice2_1_35682cf6:

    # c "Ahh! Noelle!" with vpunch
    c "啊！诺艾尔！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpyc:12997
translate schinese m10choice2_1_c8caafff:

    # n "The underwear was even worse than I expected."
    n "内衣更是糟稽透顶，比我想象的还要差。"

# game/script.rpyc:13003
translate schinese m10choice2_2_abf6b222:

    # MC "Drop it, Noelle!"
    MC "别说了，诺艾尔！"

# game/script.rpyc:13004
translate schinese m10choice2_2_7109c24d:

    # MC "Just because she's not as experienced as you are with fashion doesn't mean she's ugly."
    MC "她只是在时尚方面没你那么有经验，但这并不代表她丑。"

# game/script.rpyc:13005
translate schinese m10choice2_2_480c34e6:

    # MC "Don't you think you're being too harsh on her? One look at her and you can see how cute her face is."
    MC "你不觉得你对她太苛刻了吗？看她一眼就知道她长得有多可爱。"

# game/script.rpyc:13011
translate schinese m10choice2_2_d17bfc8d:

    # MC "Plus she's got healthy, smooth skin, bright eyes,"
    MC "而且她皮肤健康光滑，眼睛明亮，"

# game/script.rpyc:13012
translate schinese m10choice2_2_b14ae2c6:

    # MC "She's slim and small, a lot of people like that. It's like she's a small bundle of cuteness."
    MC "她身材娇小，很多人都喜欢这种类型。简直就像个可爱的“小团子”。"

# game/script.rpyc:13016
translate schinese m10choice2_2_bf55e055:

    # n "Yes, yes. That's all well and good but what is a bundle of cuteness wrapped in a shaggy package?"
    n "是啊，是啊。这些都没错，但如果这个“可爱团子”被裹在一团乱糟糟的外表里，那又算什么呢？"

# game/script.rpyc:13022
translate schinese m10choice2_2_a8ccee77:

    # n "Yes, she has a cute little face. Let's say it's the cutest in the world! One-hundred points!"
    n "没错，她有一张可爱的小脸。就算它是世界上最可爱的吧！满分！"

# game/script.rpyc:13025
translate schinese m10choice2_2_f2459097:

    # n "Consider the eye-bags, minus thirty points."
    n "考虑到那眼袋，扣三十分。"

# game/script.rpyc:13026
translate schinese m10choice2_2_62b82b09:

    # n "Not an ounce of makeup to accentuate any features. Pretty, bright irises but with no shadow to make them really pop."
    n "脸上没化一点妆来突显五官。虹膜虽然漂亮明亮，却缺乏阴影衬托，没法真正凸显神采。"

# game/script.rpyc:13029
translate schinese m10choice2_2_6162b201:

    # n "Minus another ten points."
    n "再扣十分。"

# game/script.rpyc:13030
translate schinese m10choice2_2_bda081fb:

    # n "What's worse is that we can barely see your face from most angles."
    n "更糟糕的是，从大多数角度看，几乎都看不清你的脸。"

# game/script.rpyc:13033
translate schinese m10choice2_2_7cfe1198:

    # n "It's covered up by this messy, unkempt hair that makes you look statically charged."
    n "全被那头乱蓬蓬、不修边幅的头发挡住了，看起来就像带了静电一样。"

# game/script.rpyc:13034
translate schinese m10choice2_2_57f1a96e:

    # n "Get a brush on that thing, or tie it up, just do something!"
    n "拿把梳子理理那头发，或者把它扎起来，总之做点什么吧！"

# game/script.rpyc:13037
translate schinese m10choice2_2_852239c8:

    # n "Minus eighty points!"
    n "扣八十分！"

# game/script.rpyc:13038
translate schinese m10choice2_2_d61e8df6:

    # c "Eighty?!"
    c "八十？！"

# game/script.rpyc:13041
translate schinese m10choice2_2_1abbff50:

    # n "Bland wardrobe with no personality or any way of complementing your slim figure."
    n "毫无个性的平廡穿搭，完全托期不出你苗条的身材。"

# game/script.rpyc:13042
translate schinese m10choice2_2_92b7bb83:

    # n "You don't need to be voluptuous all over! You can still make it work because you have deceptively nice hips."
    n "你不需要全身都走丰满路线！只要搭配得当，你那极具欺骗性（看起来一般其实很棒）的臀部线条完全能撑起造型。"

# game/script.rpyc:13043
translate schinese m10choice2_2_a5d11334:

    # n "You need more colors. I think you'd benefit from a more girly style."
    n "你需要更多色彩。我觉得走少女风会很适合你。"

# game/script.rpyc:13046
translate schinese m10choice2_2_bad1268f:

    # n "Overall for the clothes. Minus fifty points. It would be more if you didn't show your legs."
    n "这身行头……扣五十分。要是没露腿的话，扣分会更多。"

# game/script.rpyc:13056
translate schinese m10choice2_2_35682cf6:

    # c "Ahh! Noelle!" with vpunch
    c "啊！诺艾尔！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpyc:13063
translate schinese m10choice2_2_c8caafff:

    # n "The underwear was even worse than I expected."
    n "内衣更是糟稽透顶，比我想象的还要差。"

# game/script.rpyc:13064
translate schinese m10choice2_2_bb2cf764:

    # n "..."
    n "……"

# game/script.rpyc:13070
translate schinese m10choice2_2_c3d0c6d4:

    # n "Minus a thousand points..."
    n "扣一千分……"

# game/script.rpyc:13071
translate schinese m10choice2_2_12f0cc61:

    # MC "Are you crying?!"
    MC "你在哭吗？！"

# game/script.rpyc:13072
translate schinese m10choice2_2_93c7827a:

    # n "I always wanted a cute little sister... Grace is too tall and tomboyish to be my little doll..."
    n "我一直想要个可爱的妹妹……格蕾丝个子太高，又像个假小子，没法当我的小玩偶……"

# game/script.rpyc:13073
translate schinese m10choice2_2_bf264a31:

    # n "Chloe is the perfect fit... but she's betraying me with her laziness..."
    n "克洛伊倒是完美人选……可她那懒散的劲儿简直是在背叛我……"

# game/script.rpyc:13077
translate schinese m10choice2_2_d390b579:

    # n "See, Chloe, do you understand? I know you can be cute. [name] knows that you can be cute."
    n "你看，克洛伊，你明白吗？我知道你其实很可爱。[name]也知道你很可爱。"

# game/script.rpyc:13078
translate schinese m10choice2_2_be088045:

    # n "But right now..."
    n "但现在嘛……"

# game/script.rpyc:13083
translate schinese m10choice2_2_33b9fa41:

    # n "Minus eight-hundred-fifty points"
    n "扣掉八百五十分。"

# game/script.rpyc:13084
translate schinese m10choice2_2_99902d25:

    # m "Good Lord... Your math is atrocious."
    m "天哪……你的数学也太差劲了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13090
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_2f6abdf4:

    # m "I hate to say it, Chloe. But you could do with some help. I'm not saying you should feel obligated to conform with beauty standards."
    m "克洛伊，虽然我不想这么说，但你确实需要一些帮助。我并不是说你非得迎合那些所谓的审美标准不可。"

# game/script.rpyc:13091
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_ae46dd4a:

    # m "But you know what we mean. I didn't want to force you to do anything. But now that Noelle's brought it up, I'm taking her side."
    m "但你懂我们的意思。我本来不想强迫你做什么，可既然诺艾尔提出来了，那我支持她。"

# game/script.rpyc:13092
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_d19f855d:

    # c "..."
    c "……"

# game/script.rpyc:13096
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_fb5c7fc0:

    # MC "Then I guess I'll be the one to take Chloe's side. It's a nice idea but she's clearly uncomfortable."
    MC "那我就站在克洛伊这边吧。虽然主意不错，但她明显感到不自在。"

# game/script.rpyc:13100
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_3bbb0de4:

    # c "No, it's..."
    c "不，其实……"

# game/script.rpyc:13101
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_aaff8207:

    # c "It's true though..."
    c "不过话说回来，确实是这样……"

# game/script.rpyc:13102
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_5cfadea7:

    # c "Mom's been telling me to do it. Vineeta's been telling me to do it. I just don't know where to start."
    c "我妈一直叫我这么做，维妮塔也这么说。我只是不知道该从哪里下手。"

# game/script.rpyc:13103
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_112cb3a2:

    # n "That's what {i}I'm{/i} here for. It's not like I'm punishing you or anything. I wanna teach you how to do cool things to your hair, or how to do your makeup."
    n "所以我才在这儿啊。我又不是在惩罚你什么的。我想教你怎么给头发做些新潮的造型，或者怎么化妆。"

# game/script.rpyc:13104
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_ee19c88a:

    # n "She wants to do this, [name]. She's too shy to ask for it. And maybe too lazy to pursue it."
    n "她想做这些，[name]。只是她太害羞，不好意思开口；也许也因为太懒，没去付诸行动。"

# game/script.rpyc:13105
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_272b0d7d:

    # n "She shaves her legs and armpits, and I don't know what skin products she uses but she's as soft as a cushion."
    n "她会刮腿毛和腋毛，我不知道她用什么护肤品，但她的皮肤摸起来像靠垫一样柔软。"

# game/script.rpyc:13109
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_c4c0566c:

    # c "I don't use any skin products..."
    c "我什么护肤品都不用……"

# game/script.rpyc:13110
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_bb2cf764:

    # n "..."
    n "……"

# game/script.rpyc:13111
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_72f113f5:

    # n "Life is truly unfair..."
    n "生活真是不公平啊……"

# game/script.rpyc:13115
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_d92df191:

    # n "You're coming too, [name]. I need a pack mule, and Grace won't be here for another few hours."
    n "你也得去，[name]。我需要个苦力，而且格蕾丝还得过几个小时才到。"

# game/script.rpyc:13116
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_cec8a52c:

    # MC "Fine. I want to have the final say on Cadence's clothes."
    MC "好吧。不过关于凯登丝的衣服，我要有最终决定权。"

# game/script.rpyc:13117
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_baaab53e:

    # n "I don't think you're qualified to have the final say."
    n "我觉得你没资格做最终决定。"

# game/script.rpyc:13118
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_8ea5056e:

    # MC "Oh, please. As if I don't know when someone looks nice. Besides, I'm not worried about you failing to make her look nice."
    MC "得了吧。难道我看不出谁穿得好看吗？再说，我也不担心你会把她打扮得难看。"

# game/script.rpyc:13119
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_bdecf4f3:

    # MC "I'm more interested in keeping you under control. She doesn't need a mountain of clothes just yet. Keep it modest for now, okay?"
    MC "我更关心的是怎么管住你。她现在还不需要堆积如山的衣服。先适度一点，好吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13120
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_ed8a7d9b:

    # n "Yes, yes, I'll only think of a handful of ways to make Cadence irresistible."
    n "是啊，是啊，我只会想出几种让凯登丝变得无法抗拒的法子。"

# game/script.rpyc:13121
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_4c038c8f:

    # MC "Irresistible to whom? You? This is what I mean by keeping you under control."
    MC "对谁无法抗拒？对你吗？这就是我所说的要控制住你的原因。"

# game/script.rpyc:13122
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_eabfb770:

    # MC "I've kept those two waiting long enough. I'll get them set up and be back in a minute."
    MC "那两人已经等得够久了。我去把他们安顿好，马上回来。"

# game/script.rpyc:13129
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_dd4f832c:

    # s "{i}You're{/i} the unique person in this equation, aren't you? We've already figured out that your magic tends to operate differently than expected."
    s "{i}你可是{/i}这整件事里的那个“特例”，不是吗？我们早就发现，你的魔法运作方式往往与预期不同。"

# game/script.rpyc:13130
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_7827ade5:

    # s "You haven't attempted to cast binding before?"
    s "你以前没试过施展束缚咒吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13131
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_505f0c8d:

    # MC "Never."
    MC "从来没有。"

# game/script.rpyc:13132
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_b72079a0:

    # s "Maybe instead of it being a ruse, you overpowered her binding spell?"
    s "也许那并不是什么花招，而是你的力量压过了她的束缚咒？"

# game/script.rpyc:13133
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_e584cc82:

    # MC "No, it was definitely different. Not a feeling I could put into words. But I'm a hundred percent sure that her binding spell was a farce."
    MC "不，感觉绝对不一样。那种感觉很难用言语形容。但我百分之百确定，她的束缚咒纯粹是场闹剧。"

# game/script.rpyc:13134
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_08a79f86:

    # MC "It's an interesting suggestion. But feeling what I felt, I just know that you're wrong about that."
    MC "这个推测很有趣。但基于我的亲身体验，我很清楚你的看法是错的。"

# game/script.rpyc:13138
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_5f3ff345:

    # s "Hmm... "
    s "嗯……"

# game/script.rpyc:13139
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_9858ccde:

    # s "I know you expected me to say this, but I've really heard nothing like it before."
    s "我知道你料到我会这么说，但我确实从未听说过类似的事。"

# game/script.rpyc:13140
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_7680160f:

    # s "In your case, as remarkable as it is, I'm willing to accept you as an outlier."
    s "就你而言——尽管情况非同寻常——我愿意把你视为一个特例。"

# game/script.rpyc:13141
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_8113d244:

    # s "Mutations happen all the time in nature, I even began to theorize that your abilities are a branding of some kind."
    s "自然界中变异时有发生，我甚至曾推测你的能力是某种特殊的“烙印”。"

# game/script.rpyc:13142
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_6997e614:

    # s "But for this woman to also cast an unheard of spell like that..."
    s "但那个女人竟然也能施展那种闻所未闻的法术……"

# game/script.rpyc:13143
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_d0fbac77:

    # s "It's like a group evolution..."
    s "这就像是某种群体性的进化……"

# game/script.rpyc:13147
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_b12fd5c9:

    # s "When did she first bind you?"
    s "她是什么时候第一次与你建立这种“束缚”关系的？"

# game/script.rpyc:13148
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_a4645d93:

    # C "Five years ago."
    C "五年前。"

# game/script.rpyc:13149
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_b3b9c0e8:

    # s "Hmm..."
    s "嗯……"

# game/script.rpyc:13152
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_35b3b32f:

    # s "That's before your \"awakening\", chronologically speaking."
    s "从时间线上看，那是在你“觉醒”之前。"

# game/script.rpyc:13153
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_acea68b1:

    # s "This woman is older than you are, right?"
    s "那个女人比你年长，对吧？"

# game/script.rpyc:13154
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_488ac891:

    # MC "I'd assume so."
    MC "我想应该是的。"

# game/script.rpyc:13155
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_bda042e0:

    # C "I never found out how old she is."
    C "我始终没弄清楚她到底多大年纪。"

# game/script.rpyc:13156
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_9e1ce437:

    # MC "I mean, judging from her appearance; thirty-five is the {i}youngest{/i} I would guess her age as."
    MC "我是说，单看外表，我猜她{i}最年轻{/i}也有三十五岁了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13157
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_1f38f545:

    # C "I'd say she's in her forties, or at least close to it."
    C "我觉得她应该在四十岁左右，或者至少也快到那个年纪了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13158
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_808f151c:

    # s "That's old enough. I was considering that if she's in a similar set of circumstances to master [name], it's possible that the symptoms don't show up until a certain age."
    s "那年纪够大了。我在想，如果她的情况与主人[name]相似，症状可能要等到一定年龄才会显现。"

# game/script.rpyc:13159
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_1a68f4c1:

    # MC "Like a magical puberty?"
    MC "就像某种“魔法青春期”那样？"

# game/script.rpyc:13160
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_e9c62d94:

    # s "Something like that."
    s "算是吧。"

# game/script.rpyc:13164
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_4fe270d7:

    # C "Hmm..." (multiple=3)
    C "嗯……" (multiple=3)

# game/script.rpyc:13165
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_49469b12:

    # s "Hmm..." (multiple=3)
    s "嗯……" (multiple=3)

# game/script.rpyc:13166
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_1c276e3d:

    # MC "..." (multiple=3)
    MC "……" (multiple=3)

# game/script.rpyc:13171
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_73450ef8:

    # MC "Let's not try to force a revelation. This is all speculative anyway. We're not going to find any more leads by probing our memories."
    MC "别强求什么顿悟了。反正这一切都只是推测。光靠挖掘记忆是找不到更多线索的。"

# game/script.rpyc:13172
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_9524ad81:

    # MC "We need more to go on so until something comes up, we're stuck. I'm still working with Ron, if what's going on with me {i}is{/i} relevant, hopefully we can dig up some more information about what I can do for some more info."
    MC "我们需要更多线索，所以眼下只能先搁置了。我还在和罗纳德合作；如果我身上的状况与此有关，希望能借此挖掘出更多信息。"

# game/script.rpyc:13173
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_cc134efb:

    # MC "Let's just move on shall we?"
    MC "我们还是继续吧？"

# game/script.rpyc:13177
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_becabaaf:

    # MC "Noelle and I are gonna go out to find some clothes for you."
    MC "诺艾尔和我打算出去给你找些衣服。"

# game/script.rpyc:13178
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_8987c5c1:

    # MC "She told me you spoke on the way here about clothes so we should be able to find some stuff you'll like."
    MC "她跟我说，你们在来的路上聊过衣服的事，所以我们应该能找到一些你喜欢的。"

# game/script.rpyc:13182
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_94b283ae:

    # C "I don't even know how to thank you..."
    C "我都不知道该怎么感谢你……"

# game/script.rpyc:13183
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_38e035a7:

    # MC "Thank me by being happy."
    MC "只要你开心，就是对我最好的感谢。"

# game/script.rpyc:13187
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_8f8c5b4f:

    # MC "Help her get cleaned up and take her measurements. Noelle and Miya said you're free to use as many of their toiletries as you want."
    MC "帮她梳洗一下，顺便量量尺寸。诺艾尔和米娅说了，她们的洗漱用品你可以随意使用。"

# game/script.rpyc:13188
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_055141e9:

    # s "Don't worry about that. I'll take good care of her."
    s "放心吧，我会好好照顾她的。"

# game/script.rpyc:13192
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_73402b29:

    # MC "Last thing before I go is that I'll need those clothes so I can add them to the laundry."
    MC "走之前还有件事，我得把那些衣服拿走，好放进洗衣机里洗。"

# game/script.rpyc:13196
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_dd61cf90:

    # C "Eh?!"
    C "诶？！"

# game/script.rpyc:13197
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_df2a3501:

    # C "You're going now?"
    C "你现在就要走？"

# game/script.rpyc:13198
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_6090fb1f:

    # MC "Yeah, I'm going right now. It's better to go sooner than later, plus Noelle and Chloe are waiting for me and I'm not interested in incurring their collective wrath."
    MC "对，我这就走。宜早不宜迟，再说诺艾尔和克洛伊还在等我呢，我可不想惹她们俩联手发火。"

# game/script.rpyc:13199
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_5db70aa6:

    # MC "Believe it or not Noelle was an angsty teenager. I know what she's capable of and I'd rather avoid reliving those years."
    MC "别看现在这样，诺艾尔以前可是个满腹牢骚的叛逆少女。我很清楚她发起火来有多可怕，实在不想重温那种日子。"

# game/script.rpyc:13203
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_a6c681a5:

    # C "Umm... ah- th-then..."
    C "嗯……啊——那、那么……"

# game/script.rpyc:13212
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_abe24253:

    # MC "!!!"
    MC "！！！"

# game/script.rpyc:13223
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_e1554201:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

# game/script.rpyc:13231
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_0ad78465:

    # MCt "B-boobies!"
    MCt "胸、胸部！"

# game/script.rpyc:13232
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_7b53d272:

    # MCt "Awesome!! They're huge!"
    MCt "太棒了！！好大啊！"

# game/script.rpyc:13236
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_bac0f8c9:

    # MCt "Wait, no! That's not what I should be focusing on..."
    MCt "等等，不对！现在不该关注这个……"

# game/script.rpyc:13237
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_b0aba226:

    # MCt "Why did she undress in front of me so readily? She's blushing, right?! This isn't a normal thing for her is it?"
    MCt "她为什么这么干脆地在我面前脱衣服？她在脸红吧？！这对她来说应该不是常态吧？"

# game/script.rpyc:13238
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_760901f9:

    # MCt "Wait... is it... because she's my slave...? She thought I was ordering her to undress?"
    MCt "等等……难道是……因为她是我的奴隶……？她以为我在命令她脱衣服？"

# game/script.rpyc:13239
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_8ef7fbf5:

    # MCt "Oh, no... Cadence... you shouldn't have done that... you've opened Pandora's box."
    MCt "噢，不……凯登丝……你不该这么做的……你打开了潘多拉的魔盒。"

# game/script.rpyc:13240
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_bb268463:

    # MCt "I didn't bind you for this, Cadence... but if you wave that body around in front of my face..."
    MCt "我契约你可不是为了这种事啊，凯登丝……但如果你在我面前晃荡着那副身躯……"

# game/script.rpyc:13245
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_28274af2:

    # st "How long is he going to keep staring at her?"
    st "他还要盯着她看多久啊？"

# game/script.rpyc:13249
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_26a803bc:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script.rpyc:13250
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_620c383c:

    # C "Is... Is everything alright?.. Master..."
    C "请问……有什么问题吗……主人……？"

# game/script.rpyc:13251
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_e302000e:

    # C "Does everything look... okay?"
    C "看起来……还可以吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13252
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_9c9c2e24:

    # MCt "Yes, you fucking idiot! You look amazing! I was content with the cute ears and tail."
    MCt "是啊，你这该死的笨蛋！你看起来棒极了！光是那对可爱的耳朵和尾巴就足够让我满意了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13253
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_8d3bcf30:

    # MCt "This is bad... I need to set a precedent without embarrassing her..."
    MCt "这可不妙……我得立个规矩，但又不能让她难堪……"

# game/script.rpyc:13258
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_9fded212:

    # MC "Cadence..."
    MC "凯登丝……"

# game/script.rpyc:13262
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_11963786:

    # MC "Everything is fine, thank you. I'll get these clothes in the laundry. I don't know if you'll ever want to wear them again, though."
    MC "一切都很好，谢谢。我会把这些衣服拿去洗。不过，我不知道你以后还会不会想穿它们。"

# game/script.rpyc:13263
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_b1a14f06:

    # MC "I just wanted to make a two things clear before I go:"
    MC "在离开之前，我有两件事想明确一下："

# game/script.rpyc:13264
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_5974c330:

    # MC "The first thing I want you to understand is that from now on, you are entitled to privacy. No matter the situation."
    MC "首先，我要让你明白，从现在起，你有权享有隐私。无论在什么情况下。"

# game/script.rpyc:13265
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_d19874b6:

    # MC "Secondly, I don't plan on making any demands of you. Any and every thing I ask of you is going to be a request."
    MC "其次，我不打算对你提出任何强制要求。我对你的任何要求，都仅仅是请求。"

# game/script.rpyc:13266
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_34a841a7:

    # MC "Understood?"
    MC "明白了吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13267
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_3f16a349:

    # C "...Yes... Master..."
    C "……明白……主人……"

# game/script.rpyc:13273
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_fa08bf31:

    # MC "I'm glad to hear that."
    MC "很高兴听到你这么说。"

# game/script.rpyc:13274
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_d24f0314:

    # MC "I know it'll take a while to get used to it, but I want to give you a normal life."
    MC "我知道适应这一切需要些时间，但我希望能给你正常的生活。"

# game/script.rpyc:13275
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_3dc25d6f:

    # MC "I didn't fight for you for personal gain."
    MC "我为你争取这一切，并非出于私心。"

# game/script.rpyc:13276
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_07603734:

    # MC "Just something to think about for the meantime. If anything, do it for me."
    MC "这事你先考虑一下吧。哪怕只是为了我，也请试着接受。"

# game/script.rpyc:13294
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_4a839089:

    # s "Master [name]."
    s "主人[name]。"

# game/script.rpyc:13303
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_940e8a8c:

    # MC "What is it?"
    MC "什么事？"

# game/script.rpyc:13304
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_476710d2:

    # s "You don't want to keep the girls waiting any longer, do you?"
    s "你也不想让姑娘们久等吧？"

# game/script.rpyc:13305
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_77d30254:

    # MC "Could you give me a moment first?"
    MC "能先让我独处一会儿吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13306
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_08c92f24:

    # s "I don't think you need any more moments in here."
    s "我觉得你没必要再留在这里了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13307
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_a0422cd0:

    # MC "Yes, Master Stella."
    MC "好的，斯特拉大人。"

# game/script.rpyc:13311
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_cfdd068f:

    # MC "When you're done you should find a robe in your room. It's Noelle's. Something about the other girls' robes being \"too tight up there\"."
    MC "洗完后，你应该能在房间里找到一件长袍。那是诺艾尔的——因为其他姑娘的长袍……在胸口部位“太紧了”。"

# game/script.rpyc:13312
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_1778cddc:

    # MC "Take your time, too. This is an opportunity to relax as much as it is one to freshen up."
    MC "慢慢来就好。这既是梳洗整理的机会，也是让你放松身心的时刻。"

# game/script.rpyc:13313
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_59acf987:

    # C "Thank you, master. I never got given the time for something like this. I'm honestly looking forward to it."
    C "谢谢您，主人。我以前从未有过这样的闲暇时光。我真的很期待。"

# game/script.rpyc:13317
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_89be44c8:

    # MC "That's all I wanted to hear."
    MC "这就够了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13318
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_57b0f7f9:

    # MC "I'll see you two later."
    MC "回头见，你们俩。"

# game/script.rpyc:13319
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_dfea2f20:

    # s "See you, master [name]. And thank you. You're being extraordinarily noble."
    s "回头见，主人[name]。还有，谢谢您。您真是太高尚了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13321
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script.rpyc:13322
translate schinese m10afterchoice2_3de694c6:

    # MC "{size=-15}Am I?"
    MC "{size=-15}是吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13338
translate schinese m10choice3_1_d1c1a7f8:

    # m "Oh, hey, [name]. Noelle and Chloe are downstairs. You should go before they start getting bored."
    m "噢，嘿，[name]。诺艾尔和克洛伊在楼下呢。你最好快去，免得她们等得无聊了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13339
translate schinese m10choice3_1_aecfbd52:

    # MC "I thought I'd check up on you first, make sure everything's okay."
    MC "我本来想先来看看你，确认一下一切都好。"

# game/script.rpyc:13340
translate schinese m10choice3_1_54654a25:

    # m "Yeah, don't worry about it. It turns out this room was already in good condition. It could do with more decorations, but they'll come with time."
    m "嗯，别担心。其实这房间状况本来就很好。虽然还需要些装饰，但以后慢慢添置就行了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13341
translate schinese m10choice3_1_7d18b500:

    # m "I wonder what kind of decor she likes. Though, if I'm going to judge her from first impressions, asking her would illicit some kind of modest response."
    m "不知道她喜欢什么样的装饰。不过，凭我对她的第一印象，要是直接问她，她肯定会客气地推辞一番。"

# game/script.rpyc:13345
translate schinese m10choice3_1_3e78a831:

    # m "Probably something along the lines of \"Oh, no, you don't need to do something like that. I love this room as it is.\""
    m "大概会是这种反应：“噢，不，没必要那样做。我就喜欢这房间现在的样子。”"

# game/script.rpyc:13350
translate schinese m10choice3_1_ae6af3be:

    # m "She seems like a nice girl who's been through a lot. Is {i}going{/i} through a lot."
    m "她看起来是个好女孩，已经经历了不少坎坷。或者说，她{i}正在{/i}经历着许多难关。"

# game/script.rpyc:13351
translate schinese m10choice3_1_f4745540:

    # m "Don't let her hold herself back."
    m "别让她束缚了自己。"

# game/script.rpyc:13352
translate schinese m10choice3_1_02eff53c:

    # MC "Don't worry about that. I'll spoil her every now and then. At least until she gains confidence."
    MC "不用担心那个。我会偶尔宠宠她的，至少在她建立起自信之前。"

# game/script.rpyc:13353
translate schinese m10choice3_1_bc729b6e:

    # MC "I actually wasn't asking about the room, by the way..."
    MC "其实，我刚才问的并不是关于房间的事……"

# game/script.rpyc:13357
translate schinese m10choice3_1_220beb14:

    # MC "I was asking about you."
    MC "我问的是关于你的事。"

# game/script.rpyc:13358
translate schinese m10choice3_1_17afb047:

    # m "*Sigh*"
    m "*叹气*"

# game/script.rpyc:13359
translate schinese m10choice3_1_7f97a350:

    # m "What do {i}I{/i} have to do with anything?"
    m "这跟{i}我{/i}有什么关系？"

# game/script.rpyc:13363
translate schinese m10choice3_1_e6607cae:

    # m "You don't have to worry about me."
    m "你不用担心我。"

# game/script.rpyc:13374
translate schinese m10choice4_1_29a4f6ab:

    # m "!!!"
    m "！！！"

# game/script.rpyc:13375
translate schinese m10choice4_1_0715f9ca:

    # MC "I'm sorry! I'm sorry, Miya."
    MC "对不起！对不起，米娅。"

# game/script.rpyc:13379
translate schinese m10choice4_1_83d0062b:

    # m "[name]... what's gotten into you all of a sudden?"
    m "[name]……你突然怎么了？"

# game/script.rpyc:13380
translate schinese m10choice4_1_c7310f82:

    # m "I told you, I'm fine."
    m "我都说了，我没事。"

# game/script.rpyc:13384
translate schinese m10choice4_1_7186c71e:

    # MC "It's okay. I didn't mean for any of this to happen."
    MC "没关系。我没想过会发生这种事。"

# game/script.rpyc:13385
translate schinese m10choice4_1_b6b7a3f6:

    # MC "I fucked up. I know I did. I don't know how I can make it up to you..."
    MC "我搞砸了。我知道我搞砸了。我不知道该怎么补偿你……"

# game/script.rpyc:13391
translate schinese m10choice4_1_646e5d9d:

    # m "You don't have to make it up to me at all..."
    m "你根本不需要补偿我……"

# game/script.rpyc:13392
translate schinese m10choice4_1_f02bfcf9:

    # m "We're in this together..."
    m "我们是一起面对这一切的……"

# game/script.rpyc:13402
translate schinese m10choice4_2_5ce2f92a:

    # MC "I fucked up. I know I did. I didn't mean for any of this to happen to you."
    MC "我搞砸了。我知道我搞砸了。我没想过会让你遭遇这种事。"

# game/script.rpyc:13403
translate schinese m10choice4_2_158a28e8:

    # m "Hindsight is twenty-twenty, [name]."
    m "事后回想起来总是看得最清楚，[name]。"

# game/script.rpyc:13407
translate schinese m10choice4_2_23c45387:

    # m "I get through these things. I always do. I've seen more hardships than you have. Even caused more than you have."
    m "我能挺过这些事。我向来都能挺过去。我经历过的磨难比你多。甚至造成的麻烦也比你多。"

# game/script.rpyc:13408
translate schinese m10choice4_2_d9865d79:

    # m "Nothing this outright ludicrous, but still."
    m "虽然没遇到过这么荒唐离谱的事，但总归是经历过风浪的。"

# game/script.rpyc:13413
translate schinese m10choice4_2_9bf64474:

    # m "Go ahead. I'll figure this out."
    m "你去忙吧。我会想办法解决的。"

# game/script.rpyc:13418
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_96f485b2:

    # MC "You know, I was expecting you guys to be inside while you waited."
    MC "说真的，我本来以为你们会在里面等着的。"

# game/script.rpyc:13419
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_c73039f6:

    # MC "You had me searching the house when all you had to do was tell me you're working on your tans."
    MC "你害得我在屋里到处找你，其实你只要告诉我你在晒日光浴就行了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13423
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_440286da:

    # n "I'm pretty sure I inherited mom's anti-tanning genes. If I'm spending any amount of prolonged time in the sun, I need an industrial vat of sunscreen."
    n "我敢肯定我遗传了妈妈那种“晒不黑”的基因。只要在太阳下待久一点，我就得用工业级大桶装的防晒霜才行。"

# game/script.rpyc:13424
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_b161cef7:

    # n "Option A is me being fried by the sun, option B is me keeping my skin without having to peel it off, but my complexion staying the same."
    n "摆在我面前的选项是：要么被太阳烤焦，要么保住皮肤（不用忍受脱皮之苦）但肤色保持原样。"

# game/script.rpyc:13425
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_9a2037fe:

    # n "I think it's an easy choice."
    n "我觉得这很好选。"

# game/script.rpyc:13426
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_d3242c11:

    # MC "Speaking of tan, do you think that's Cadence's natural skin color?"
    MC "说到晒黑，你觉得那是凯登丝天生的肤色吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13427
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_a33f61a1:

    # n "Looks like it. Obviously I haven't seen her without clothes on, but I couldn't see any tan-lines peeking out."
    n "看起来是。虽然我没见过她不穿衣服的样子，但我没看到有什么晒痕露出来。"

# game/script.rpyc:13428
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_bbffb1c8:

    # n "It's probably something to do with the breed of cat she is."
    n "这可能跟她的猫品种有关。"

# game/script.rpyc:13429
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_006e8d27:

    # MC "That was my thought, too. I noticed she had a thicker tail, too. I wondered if it was a desert cat or something."
    MC "我也是这么想的。我还注意到她的尾巴比较粗。我在想她是不是沙漠猫之类的品种。"

# game/script.rpyc:13430
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_faf89b4b:

    # MC "By the way. Are we still taking Chlo-"
    MC "对了，我们还要带克洛——"

# game/script.rpyc:13431
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script.rpyc:13432
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_53dbcaf5:

    # MC "Is that Chloe?"
    MC "那是克洛伊吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13437
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_9390f718:

    # n "Sure is."
    n "确实如此。"

# game/script.rpyc:13438
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_36f06bf6:

    # n "I didn't have time for any makeup. Honestly, I'm not sure if I even have any in colors that would suit her best."
    n "我没时间化妆。老实说，我都不确定自己有没有适合她的色号。"

# game/script.rpyc:13442
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_75527e80:

    # n "It turns out that she has a little bit of waviness in her hair."
    n "原来她的头发带点波浪卷。"

# game/script.rpyc:13443
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_7e4788b5:

    # n "You just have to coax it out."
    n "只要稍微打理一下就能显现出来了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13447
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_fb26c925:

    # n "I'd say I did a nice job."
    n "我觉得我做得挺不错的。"

# game/script.rpyc:13448
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_bfd171b2:

    # n "I can't wait to see her all dressed up."
    n "真期待看到她盛装打扮的样子。"

# game/script.rpyc:13449
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_e3e295b1:

    # n "So what do you think, [name]? Isn't she adorable?"
    n "你觉得怎么样，[name]？她是不是很可爱？"

# game/script.rpyc:13453
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_8c8563dd:

    # c "Can we go now?"
    c "我们现在能走了吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13454
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_308b4888:

    # n "No, no! I can't leave you like this without a review."
    n "不行，不行！我不能就这样让你走，还没做个点评呢。"

# game/script.rpyc:13455
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_50882001:

    # c "I don't want a review!"
    c "我才不要什么点评！"

# game/script.rpyc:13456
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_082c291e:

    # n "{i}I{/i} do. I put in the work. You just had to sit there and look pretty."
    n "{i}我{/i}确实费了番功夫。你只要坐在那儿，漂漂亮亮的就行了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13460
translate schinese m10afterchoice3_1879ef00:

    # n "So whadd'ya think, [name]? She looks way better like this, right?"
    n "那你觉得怎么样，[name]？她这样看起来好多了，对吧？"

# game/script.rpyc:13466
translate schinese m10choice5_1_81809129:

    # MC "I'm not gonna lie..."
    MC "老实说……"

# game/script.rpyc:13467
translate schinese m10choice5_1_c29d8318:

    # MC "This is your department, Noelle. I'm not really good at this kinda stuff."
    MC "这可是你的专长啊，诺艾尔。我不太擅长这种事。"

# game/script.rpyc:13468
translate schinese m10choice5_1_71a69832:

    # MC "She looks good, I guess. I can't exactly tell when I see a good hairstyle."
    MC "看起来挺不错的吧。不过，我其实不太懂怎么鉴赏发型。"

# game/script.rpyc:13472
translate schinese m10choice5_1_fbfb49cb:

    # n "Why are you using your brain so much? When you eat nice food do you sit there describing to yourself why you like it?"
    n "干嘛非得动脑筋想那么多？吃美食的时候，你会坐在那儿分析自己为什么喜欢它吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13473
translate schinese m10choice5_1_678c829c:

    # MC "Uhh... I guess not..."
    MC "呃……好像不会……"

# game/script.rpyc:13474
translate schinese m10choice5_1_56e349ec:

    # n "This is the same thing. What does your gut tell you?"
    n "这道理是一样的。你的直觉告诉你什么？"

# game/script.rpyc:13475
translate schinese m10choice5_1_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script.rpyc:13476
translate schinese m10choice5_1_fc593d9a:

    # MC "Nothing. Sorry."
    MC "什么也没告诉我。抱歉。"

# game/script.rpyc:13482
translate schinese m10choice5_1_d08cdab9:

    # n "I think I understand what's going on here."
    n "我想我明白是怎么回事了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13483
translate schinese m10choice5_1_d9a36d8b:

    # MC "There's something going on here?"
    MC "这儿有什么情况吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13489
translate schinese m10choice5_1_26311912:

    # n "Your standards are too low."
    n "你的眼光太差了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13490
translate schinese m10choice5_1_0d8a46e2:

    # MC "My standards?"
    MC "我的眼光？"

# game/script.rpyc:13491
translate schinese m10choice5_1_083e3565:

    # n "You wouldn't know a pretty girl if she hit you in the face."
    n "就算美女迎面撞上你，你都认不出来。"

# game/script.rpyc:13495
translate schinese m10choice5_1_0e17e1e0:

    # n "It pains me to know you have such poor taste."
    n "真让人痛心，你的品味竟然这么差。"

# game/script.rpyc:13496
translate schinese m10choice5_1_42c47c1e:

    # MC "Yeah, whatever. Can we get going now? I'm here to carry stuff, not rate people's appearances."
    MC "行吧，随你怎么说。我们能出发了吗？我是来搬东西的，又不是来给别人的长相打分的。"

# game/script.rpyc:13497
translate schinese m10choice5_1_495ae103:

    # n "Yes, yes, very well."
    n "好好好，知道了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13500
translate schinese m10choice5_2_c85bd369:

    # MC "She looked better before, honestly."
    MC "老实说，她以前的样子更好看。"

# game/script.rpyc:13505
translate schinese m10choice5_2_c14f93de:

    # n "Wha-"
    n "什——"

# game/script.rpyc:13506
translate schinese m10choice5_2_6c870561:

    # MC "I preferred the messy look. It fits her like a glove."
    MC "我更喜欢她那种随性的样子，那风格简直太适合她了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13510
translate schinese m10choice5_2_14635171:

    # MC "You were right about her face, but I honestly think she looks cute regardless of her hairstyle. I'd much rather see the natural Chloe."
    MC "关于她的长相你说得对，但我真心觉得不管什么发型她都很可爱。我更喜欢看到那个自然的克洛伊。"

# game/script.rpyc:13518
translate schinese m10choice5_2_602359f2:

    # n "Is that so? My work... my style... is inferior to that shaggy mess..."
    n "是这样吗？我的作品……我的风格……竟然比不上那个乱蓬蓬的家伙……"

# game/script.rpyc:13519
translate schinese m10choice5_2_ea6de8f1:

    # n "I thought about it, you know... I thought about which styles could sculpt themselves around her face for maximum appeal..."
    n "我可是深思熟虑过的……琢磨着什么样的发型能最完美地衬托她的脸庞……"

# game/script.rpyc:13520
translate schinese m10choice5_2_1fc0f8fb:

    # n "And I was wrong?"
    n "难道我错了吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13521
translate schinese m10choice5_2_7167dea1:

    # MC "Forget about it, Noelle. Let's go."
    MC "别想那么多了，诺艾尔。我们走吧。"

# game/script.rpyc:13530
translate schinese m10choice5_2_a341c2fc:

    # n "Fine."
    n "很好。"

# game/script.rpyc:13533
translate schinese m10choice5_3_fbb053c4:

    # MC "You're doing God's work, Noelle!"
    MC "诺艾尔，你做的事简直是神迹！"

# game/script.rpyc:13537
translate schinese m10choice5_3_fd9a8696:

    # n "Right?!"
    n "对吧？！"

# game/script.rpyc:13538
translate schinese m10choice5_3_13175e59:

    # MC "I'm glad we have you, Noelle! I wouldn't even know where to start if it was {i}my{/i} job."
    MC "真高兴有你在，诺艾尔！要是这活儿落到{i}我{/i}头上，我都不知道该从哪儿下手。"

# game/script.rpyc:13539
translate schinese m10choice5_3_4688930f:

    # MC "I love being able to see both of her eyes, hell, I never thought I'd say this but I love being able to see the ears, too."
    MC "我喜欢能看到她双眼的样子——说真的，我从没想过自己会这么说，但我甚至喜欢能看到她耳朵的样子。"

# game/script.rpyc:13540
translate schinese m10choice5_3_969d96f0:

    # MC "You settled with a ponytail?"
    MC "最后选了扎马尾？"

# game/script.rpyc:13541
translate schinese m10choice5_3_a58486c9:

    # n "Not extravagant enough for you?"
    n "觉得不够华丽？"

# game/script.rpyc:13542
translate schinese m10choice5_3_47cdf30c:

    # MC "Nono! It's perfect. Keeping it simple. Less is more."
    MC "不不！这很完美。保持简约就好。少即是多。"

# game/script.rpyc:13543
translate schinese m10choice5_3_2c03caec:

    # MC "For small girls..."
    MC "对于小个子女生来说……"

# game/script.rpyc:13544
translate schinese m10choice5_3_8b21b482:

    # n "The ponytail is a secret weapon."
    n "马尾辫可是秘密武器。"

# game/script.rpyc:13557
translate schinese m10choice5_3_f140986a:

    # n "My man!"
    n "说得好！"

# game/script.rpyc:13572
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_f90b3f0a:

    # C "I have a question for {i}you{/i} this time."
    C "这次轮到我有问题要问{i}你{/i}了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13573
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_4d2f546d:

    # s "Hmm... Alright, then. I suppose this conversation has been pretty one-sided."
    s "嗯……好吧。看来之前的对话一直都是我在唱独角戏。"

# game/script.rpyc:13574
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_0e2af398:

    # C "What's your relationship with Master?"
    C "你和主人是什么关系？"

# game/script.rpyc:13575
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_b312c400:

    # s "That's a surprisingly long story, considering I've only known him a few days... I guess I'll need to start by explaining my {i}own{/i} circumstances."
    s "说来话长，尽管我认识他才没几天……我想我得先从我{i}自己{/i}的情况说起。"

# game/script.rpyc:13580
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_3d50fbf8:

    # s "I'm bound to a professor of magic at a local university."
    s "我与当地一所大学的魔法教授缔结了契约。"

# game/script.rpyc:13581
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_01e72143:

    # C "Is it Rockwell?"
    C "是罗克韦尔吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13582
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_48817a35:

    # s "That's the one."
    s "就是那个。"

# game/script.rpyc:13583
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_c1a9d651:

    # s "So I was brought up with a lot of his influence, he taught me a lot of magic and magical theory-"
    s "所以我是在他的深刻影响下长大的，他教了我许多魔法和魔法理论——"

# game/script.rpyc:13587
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_4476a039:

    # C "Wait a second- What do you mean by \"brought up\"? I thought you were bound to him?"
    C "等等——你说的“抚养长大”是什么意思？我以为你是被他束缚住的？"

# game/script.rpyc:13591
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_2f70fdde:

    # s "You see, the person who bound me, and the person who raised me, are one and the same."
    s "其实，那个束缚我的人，和那个抚养我长大的人，是同一个人。"

# game/script.rpyc:13592
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_01d13139:

    # C "Wha-"
    C "什——"

# game/script.rpyc:13596
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_ffdb1ca4:

    # C "Why did he bind you?! After raising you for so long? And you {i}agreed{/i} to it?"
    C "他为什么要束缚你？！明明把你养了那么久？而且你还{i}同意{/i}了？"

# game/script.rpyc:13599
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_0ef06a93:

    # s "It's complicated, and not how you think it is."
    s "情况很复杂，而且和你想象的不一样。"

# game/script.rpyc:13600
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_77e87a27:

    # s "I've been bound to him for a long time. Since I was five. I don't remember the binding, and I don't remember my biological family."
    s "我和他之间的契约束缚由来已久。从我五岁起就开始了。我不记得当时缔结契约的情形，也不记得我的亲生家庭。"

# game/script.rpyc:13603
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_895c11cb:

    # C "Wait, wait, wait! {i}How{/i} were you bound as a child? People don't become susceptible to binding until they've matured don't they?"
    C "等等，等等！你是怎么在孩童时期就被束缚的？人不是要等到成年后才会容易受到这种束缚的影响吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13604
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_d7f5d09d:

    # C "Because children would be too easy to coerce into agreeing to it?"
    C "是因为小孩子太容易被胁迫同意了吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13607
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_55c0e5ac:

    # s "That's right. Even so, there are records of prepubescent slaves throughout history. So we know it {i}is{/i} possible. There might be research into it, but when doing my own, I couldn't find any concrete reasoning."
    s "没错。尽管如此，历史上还是有关于未成年奴隶的记载。所以我们知道这是有可能发生的。也许有人对此做过研究，但我自己查阅资料时，没能找到确切的解释。"

# game/script.rpyc:13608
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_84af9152:

    # s "In short, that is a mystery in and of itself, let alone my lack of memories."
    s "总之，光是这件事本身就是一个谜，更别提我还失去了记忆。"

# game/script.rpyc:13609
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_3c3327b0:

    # s "Ronald got me from a market, he also couldn't believe he found someone so young there. I'm glad it was him looking out for me and not some kind of creep with bad intentions..."
    s "罗纳德是在市场上发现我的；连他自己都不敢相信，竟然会在那种地方遇到这么小的孩子。幸好当时照顾我的是他，而不是什么居心叵测的怪人……"

# game/script.rpyc:13613
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_e1554201:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

# game/script.rpyc:13618
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_353a1497:

    # s "Why am I telling you all of this again?"
    s "我怎么又跟你说起这些了？"

# game/script.rpyc:13619
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_92f85c41:

    # C "I asked you about master and we got distracted."
    C "本来是在聊关于“主人”的事，结果话题扯远了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13620
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_88285ade:

    # s "Right."
    s "没错。"

# game/script.rpyc:13624
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_df41ddef:

    # s "So we know that master [name] is unusual, magically speaking. But it gets even stranger than that."
    s "我们都知道，从魔法的角度来看，主人[name]很特别。但情况远比这更离奇。"

# game/script.rpyc:13625
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_3d36cabb:

    # s "He tells us he's only recently been able to properly utilize magic. Not that he's been dull, he's always been attuned to magic."
    s "他说自己直到最近才学会如何正确运用魔法。这并不是说他迟钝，其实他一直都能感知到魔法的存在。"

# game/script.rpyc:13626
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_092e5119:

    # s "Yet he couldn't consciously casts spells. Suddenly, he finds himself able to."
    s "但他以前无法有意识地施展法术，却突然间发现自己能做到了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13627
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_0a878efe:

    # s "Even now, his control over his magic can be described as erratic at best. He exhibits bizarre symptoms when casting spells, such as projecting a magical aura, or his eyes will light up..."
    s "即便到了现在，他对魔法的控制力也只能说是极不稳定。施法时，他会表现出一些怪异的征兆，比如周身散发出魔法光晕，或者双眼发光……"

# game/script.rpyc:13628
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_7036935a:

    # s "This is how Ronald found him. He was casting a spell in public, magnetism, I believe. The simplest spell."
    s "罗纳德就是这样发现他的。当时他在公共场合施展法术——好像是“磁力”术吧，最简单的那种法术。"

# game/script.rpyc:13632
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_d486b008:

    # s "Since then, they've made a deal where Ronald offers his tutelage. Ronald and me living together is how I became acquainted with him."
    s "从那以后，我们达成了一个协议：由罗纳德来指导我。我和罗纳德住在一起，也就是这么认识他的。"

# game/script.rpyc:13633
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_f4b47240:

    # s "As of right now, he's still at a level where {i}I{/i} can tutor him, and have done so."
    s "目前，他的水平还在我能指导的范围内，而且我也确实一直在教他。"

# game/script.rpyc:13634
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_30b87eda:

    # s "It's uh... surprising how little he knows. Even less than a dull person his age would. It's especially surprising given how clever he is, as well as an extremely fast learner."
    s "说真的……他对这方面的了解少得惊人。甚至比同龄的迟钝之辈还要少。考虑到他其实很聪明，而且学东西极快，这就更让人惊讶了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13635
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_e1554201_1:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

# game/script.rpyc:13636
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_218a62fd:

    # s "I wonder if he had a reason to avoid learning about magic... like a phobia, or something else pushing him away from it..."
    s "我在想，他是不是有什么理由刻意回避学习魔法……比如某种恐惧症，或者其他什么原因让他对此敬而远之……"

# game/script.rpyc:13641
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_b3b9c0e8:

    # s "Hmm..."
    s "嗯……"

# game/script.rpyc:13642
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_26a803bc:

    # C "..."
    C "……"

# game/script.rpyc:13643
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_8caa192e:

    # C "Okay, second question:"
    C "好了，第二个问题："

# game/script.rpyc:13644
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_f618dd27:

    # C "Do you have a crush on him?"
    C "你是不是喜欢他？"

# game/script.rpyc:13649
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_cdafe9fa:

    # s "Wait, what did you just ask me?"
    s "等等，你刚才问什么？"

# game/script.rpyc:13650
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_f36e20f6:

    # C "I asked if you have a crush on him."
    C "我问你是不是喜欢他。"

# game/script.rpyc:13654
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_52a139fc:

    # s "Hiiii-" with vpunch
    s "哎——" with vpunch

# game/script.rpyc:13655
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_a0cbf697:

    # s "What makes you ask that?!" with vpunch
    s "你怎么会这么问？！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpyc:13659
translate schinese m10afterchoice5_1ae2b14b:

    # C "Earlier, when he was looking at my body. I got super nervous. I'm not used to being looked at like that."
