translate schinese m10choice6_1_d1611e61:

    # MC "Chloe, I can't truthfully say I expected this but..."
    MC "克洛伊，我没法说我预料到了这一幕，但是……"

# game/script.rpyc:13922
translate schinese m10choice6_1_b6447d1e:

    # MC "You're pulling it off so well... I can't believe it!"
    MC "你穿起来效果太棒了……简直难以置信！"

# game/script.rpyc:13926
translate schinese m10choice6_1_e91adff5:

    # c "I am?!"
    c "真的吗？！"

# game/script.rpyc:13927
translate schinese m10choice6_1_b03cac92:

    # MC "Yeah, I'm serious. Genuinely, it suits you perfectly."
    MC "嗯，我是认真的。真的，它非常适合你。"

# game/script.rpyc:13928
translate schinese m10choice6_1_0b5d9e88:

    # MC "It strikes that perfect balance between excessive flashiness and bland modesty. It makes you look cute, but in a way where I can still take you seriously..."
    MC "它在过于花哨和过于朴素之间找到了完美的平衡。它让你看起来很可爱，但又不会让人觉得你不够稳重……"

# game/script.rpyc:13930
translate schinese m10choice6_1_2d2da1a9:

    # c "Wh-"
    c "什——"

# game/script.rpyc:13934
translate schinese m10choice6_1_29fd2cf3:

    # c "What do you mean when you say that you can \"take me seriously\"?"
    c "你说能“认真对待我”是什么意思？"

# game/script.rpyc:13935
translate schinese m10choice6_1_ba75e92d:

    # MC "Uhh..."
    MC "呃……"

# game/script.rpyc:13936
translate schinese m10choice6_1_67735c52:

    # c "Are you... saying that you-"
    c "你是……在说你——"

# game/script.rpyc:13941
translate schinese m10choice6_2_950d8e94:

    # MC "I mean... it's alright... I guess..."
    MC "我是说……没关系……大概吧……"

# game/script.rpyc:13942
translate schinese m10choice6_2_297d93f3:

    # c "What?"
    c "什么？"

# game/script.rpyc:13943
translate schinese m10choice6_2_9a9821bc:

    # MC "It's just underwear, isn't it? As I said: Yeah, you look alright. I don't think I saw what you were wearing beforehand but I'm sure it's an improvement."
    MC "不就是内衣嘛，对吧？就像我说的：嗯，你看起来挺不错的。虽然我不记得你之前穿什么，但这肯定比以前好。"

# game/script.rpyc:13944
translate schinese m10choice6_2_9ba03800:

    # MCt "Wait a second..."
    MCt "等等……"

# game/script.rpyc:13945
translate schinese m10choice6_2_017fe812:

    # MCt "I worded that HORRIBLY! I was trying to ease her and I made it sound like I found her boring."
    MCt "我刚才那话说的太糟糕了！我本来想让她放松点，结果听起来却像是我觉得她很无聊。"

# game/script.rpyc:13946
translate schinese m10choice6_2_0a238e0c:

    # MCt "Okay, I can salvage this. I need to backpedal and-"
    MCt "好吧，还有救。我得赶紧找补一下，然后——"

# game/script.rpyc:13951
translate schinese m10choice6_2_d0ae06d2:

    # c "Is that so?"
    c "是吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:13952
translate schinese m10choice6_2_b4037bf5:

    # MC "Wait a second, Chloe! Let me finish."
    MC "等等，克洛伊！让我把话说完。"

# game/script.rpyc:13957
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_2148cedd:

    # n "[name]! Are you still in here somewhere? Where are you?"
    n "[name]！你还在附近吗？你在哪儿？"

# game/script.rpyc:13958
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_3f932fc0:

    # n "[name]?! Hello?! I've got a map of the store in my head now. I need you to help me grab everything so we can take it to the checkout."
    n "[name]？！喂？！我现在脑子里已经有这家店的地图了。我需要你帮我把这些东西都拿上，我们好去结账。"

# game/script.rpyc:13959
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_7d2ca1ea:

    # MC "I don't think I want Noelle finding her way into this room any time soon..."
    MC "我可不想让诺艾尔这么快就找到这间屋子来……"

# game/script.rpyc:13960
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_88df38a7:

    # c "Agreed."
    c "同意。"

# game/script.rpyc:13976
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_a59a7635:

    # MCt "At least she didn't run away."
    MCt "至少她没跑掉。"

# game/script.rpyc:13981
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_b5ddffc9:

    # MC "Cadence doesn't need all of these, you basket case! Are you doing this purely to witness my suffering?!"
    MC "凯登丝根本不需要这么多东西，你这个疯子！你这么做纯粹是为了看我受罪吗？！"

# game/script.rpyc:13982
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_ae3caad0:

    # MC "If you chose all of these because you couldn't keep your decisions concise, you could've just sent me on my own."
    MC "如果你选这些是因为自己拿不定主意、没法精简选择，那你完全可以让我一个人来买。"

# game/script.rpyc:13983
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_421bee51:

    # MC "I'm equally as capable of buying a little bit of everything."
    MC "我也完全有能力每样都买一点。"

# game/script.rpyc:13987
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_b1f2ee5d:

    # MC "Ugh!" with vpunch
    MC "呃！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpyc:13991
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_a1db101c:

    # MC "Phew. I seriously doubted your abilities to make me work up a sweat today. But there's so many outfits here it feels like I'm hoisting a fucking Atlas Ball."
    MC "呼。我本来还怀疑你今天能不能让我出出汗呢。但这儿的衣服实在太多了，感觉就像在搬那个该死的阿特拉斯球（Atlas Ball）一样沉。"

# game/script.rpyc:13995
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_d08b3327:

    # n "Oh, quit your bitching. I'm happy, Cadence is happy, everyone is happy."
    n "噢，别抱怨了。我很高兴，凯登丝也很高兴，大家都很高兴。"

# game/script.rpyc:13996
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_54a1e95e:

    # n "Get all of these scanned, will ya'? I'm gonna find Chloe."
    n "把这些都扫描一下，好吗？我要去找克洛伊了。"

# game/script.rpyc:13997
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_a6b67182:

    # MC "I have to do {i}that{/i}, too?"
    MC "我也得做{i}那个{/i}吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14002
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_20fdf758:

    # MC "For fuck's sake."
    MC "真他妈的。"

# game/script.rpyc:14016
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_60363ca5:

    # dev "Don't worry about it. I'm happy to help."
    dev "别担心。我很乐意帮忙。"

# game/script.rpyc:14028
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script.rpyc:14029
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_5cdd615a:

    # MC "Do you work here?"
    MC "你在这儿工作吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14030
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_d0d4bc26:

    # dev "Yes."
    dev "对。"

# game/script.rpyc:14031
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_3c3d2d6e:

    # MC "Are you following me?"
    MC "你在跟踪我吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14032
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_d0d4bc26_1:

    # dev "Yes."
    dev "对。"

# game/script.rpyc:14033
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_0b082f9f:

    # MC "Am I the only one who acknowledges you?"
    MC "难道只有我理会你吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14034
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_d0d4bc26_2:

    # dev "Yes."
    dev "对。"

# game/script.rpyc:14035
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_8c875d13:

    # MC "Are you important to the story?"
    MC "你在故事里很重要吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14036
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_08b8d622:

    # dev "No."
    dev "不。"

# game/script.rpyc:14037
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_da0ffd86:

    # MC "Then why do you keep showing up?"
    MC "那你为什么总是出现？"

# game/script.rpyc:14038
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_c8fd9873:

    # dev "To offer advice at important moments."
    dev "为了在关键时刻提供建议。"

# game/script.rpyc:14041
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_157b0441:

    # dev "Such as right now."
    dev "比如现在。"

# game/script.rpyc:14042
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_de939979:

    # dev "Maybe you should consider coming back here when you next have some {i}free time{/i}."
    dev "也许你该考虑下次{i}有空{/i}的时候再来这里。"

# game/script.rpyc:14043
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_552d4c49:

    # MC "And why would that be?"
    MC "为什么要来？"

# game/script.rpyc:14044
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_960f809a:

    # dev "I will explain further once you return."
    dev "等你回来我再细说。"

# game/script.rpyc:14048
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_e3bf1fd9:

    # MC "You gonna scan all my shit now?"
    MC "你现在要扫描我所有的东西吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14055
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_0d752327:

    # MCt "It's over... I will never financially recover from binding Cadence..."
    MCt "完了……绑定凯登丝之后，我的财务状况再也翻不了身了……"

# game/script.rpyc:14056
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_2e0d312d:

    # MCt "She better wear every damn piece of clothing or I swear to God..."
    MCt "她最好把每一件该死的衣服都穿上，否则我发誓……"

# game/script.rpyc:14057
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_97e9746e:

    # n "Wake up, sleepyhead! We've got some more clothes to ring up!"
    n "醒醒，小懒虫！还有些衣服要结账呢！"

# game/script.rpyc:14058
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_972ddfbc:

    # MC "Can't you see I've suffered enough?!"
    MC "难道你看不出我已经受够了苦吗？！"

# game/script.rpyc:14059
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_77ec1480:

    # MC "How could you be so cruel as to abandon me to buy these by myself?"
    MC "你怎么能这么狠心，把我丢下让我一个人去买这些东西？"

# game/script.rpyc:14060
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_22884c79:

    # n "I'm impressed by your sense of initiative but I told you to get them scanned, not bought."
    n "我很欣赏你的主动性，但我当时是让你把它们扫描下来，而不是买下来。"

# game/script.rpyc:14061
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_f4a31de4:

    # n "Move, I'm covering this next set."
    n "让开，下一组由我来负责。"

# game/script.rpyc:14062
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_31f92326:

    # MC "You seriously found more?"
    MC "你真的又找到了更多？"

# game/script.rpyc:14063
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_6a7076d0:

    # n "This isn't for Cadence."
    n "这不是给凯登丝的。"

# game/script.rpyc:14064
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_90bc9fde:

    # MC "Your own?"
    MC "是你自己的？"

# game/script.rpyc:14065
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_3434a726:

    # n "Pick the third option."
    n "选第三个选项。"

# game/script.rpyc:14074
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_802dfeac:

    # c "It's... for me."
    c "这是……给我的。"

# game/script.rpyc:14078
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_c04ebeba:

    # n "Hehe! This is what we came up with! Believe it or not we picked this out as a team!"
    n "嘿嘿！这是我们的成果！信不信由你，这可是我们团队一起选出来的！"

# game/script.rpyc:14079
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_9a6d0cc9:

    # c "Some of the stuff Noelle wanted was too... flashy for me."
    c "诺艾尔想要的一些东西，对我来说太……招摇了。"

# game/script.rpyc:14080
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_a10f28bd:

    # n "Ain't that an understatement? We had so much back-and-forth. I didn't know you had it in you."
    n "何止是招摇啊？我们可是反复商量了好久。真没想到你还有这一面。"

# game/script.rpyc:14081
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_79cdda7a:

    # n "This way is much better. If I forced you into a getup you didn't actually like, you'd be less likely to come back here yourself."
    n "这样好多了。如果我强迫你穿上你不喜欢的行头，你恐怕就不愿再来这儿了。"

# game/script.rpyc:14085
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_04282bcb:

    # c "I don't really... think I can do that. You still did all of the work for me."
    c "我真的……不觉得自己能行。毕竟还是全靠你帮我搞定的。"

# game/script.rpyc:14086
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_8e37916f:

    # n "Then I will come with you. Again and again until you get the gist of it."
    n "那我就陪你一起来。一次又一次，直到你掌握要领为止。"

# game/script.rpyc:14090
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_ae490ac6:

    # MC "It suits you, Chloe."
    MC "这身很适合你，克洛伊。"

# game/script.rpyc:14091
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_fd9a8696:

    # n "Right?!"
    n "对吧？！"

# game/script.rpyc:14092
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_361a8e55:

    # c "S-shut up..."
    c "闭、闭嘴……"

# game/script.rpyc:14093
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_1de62439:

    # MC "It helps a lot. It makes you look more... how do I say this? Alive?"
    MC "这很有帮助。让你看起来更……怎么说呢？更有生气？"

# game/script.rpyc:14097
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_4e91af57:

    # MC "It's good. I want to see you like this more often."
    MC "真好。我希望能经常看到你这副模样。"

# game/script.rpyc:14101
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_282c8ad2:

    # n "And you will, I'm sure of it. But right now we need to get out of here."
    n "你会看到的，我敢肯定。不过现在我们得离开这儿了。"

# game/script.rpyc:14102
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_f5c034db:

    # n "We're still busy with the whole, you know, Cadence situation."
    n "我们还在忙着处理……你知道的，就是关于凯登丝的那些事儿。"

# game/script.rpyc:14103
translate schinese m10afterchoice6_49e9db1a:

    # n "C'mon, let's go! Save your compliments for the journey."
    n "来吧，我们走！恭维的话留到路上再说。"

# game/script.rpyc:14113
translate schinese main11_bb2cf764:

    # n "..."
    n "……"

# game/script.rpyc:14114
translate schinese main11_f39a468f:

    # MC "What exactly do you plan on hearing?"
    MC "你到底想听到什么？"

# game/script.rpyc:14115
translate schinese main11_8a7a5578:

    # n "I dunno. Something juicy."
    n "不知道。来点劲爆的料呗。"

# game/script.rpyc:14116
translate schinese main11_3c734d6b:

    # MC "Like what?"
    MC "比如什么？"

# game/script.rpyc:14117
translate schinese main11_374df1dd:

    # n "Could be anything. Girls don't hold anything back when it comes to private conversations."
    n "什么都行。女孩子私下聊天时可是什么都敢说的。"

# game/script.rpyc:14118
translate schinese main11_2f1d5422:

    # MC "Do you do this to my door?"
    MC "你会对我房门做这种事吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14119
translate schinese main11_ce79b29f:

    # n "Why would I? Do you talk to yourself? We all know you aren't harboring anyone in there."
    n "我为什么要那么做？你会自言自语吗？我们都知道你房间里没藏着什么人。"

# game/script.rpyc:14120
translate schinese main11_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script.rpyc:14124
translate schinese main11_bb2cf764_1:

    # n "..."
    n "……"

# game/script.rpyc:14125
translate schinese main11_abc5c288:

    # n "Sorry... was that too harsh?"
    n "抱歉……刚才话说重了吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14126
translate schinese main11_279194fd:

    # MC "Just stop eavesdropping on them, will you? They could be talking about all kinds of sensitive stuff in there."
    MC "总之别再偷听她们了，好吗？她们在里面可能会聊些很敏感的话题。"

# game/script.rpyc:14139
translate schinese main11_19e98752:

    # n "Hmm."
    n "嗯。"

# game/script.rpyc:14140
translate schinese main11_d1c0cb32:

    # n "So by telling me to stop listening, you're implying that you should take my place, is that it?"
    n "所以，你叫我别听，是暗示应该由你来接替我听，是这个意思吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14141
translate schinese main11_d549f6f6:

    # MC "Noelle, darling. You should know that circumstances are subject to change when the situation suddenly revolves around you."
    MC "诺艾尔，亲爱的。你要明白，一旦事态突然围绕着你展开，情况就会发生变化。"

# game/script.rpyc:14142
translate schinese main11_48193d90:

    # n "What about your earlier logic? Shouldn't the subject matter be irrelevant when it comes to breaches of privacy?"
    n "那你之前的逻辑呢？说到侵犯隐私，具体涉及什么内容不应该无关紧要吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14143
translate schinese main11_88896fb6:

    # MC "How could it possibly be private when my likeness is in the public domain."
    MC "既然我的形象都已处于公共领域，怎么还能说是隐私呢？"

# game/script.rpyc:14144
translate schinese main11_63f61f09:

    # n "Since when have you been in the public domain?"
    n "你从什么时候开始属于公共领域了？"

# game/script.rpyc:14145
translate schinese main11_17929700:

    # MC "Since I wanted to hear what they have to say about me."
    MC "从我想听听他们怎么议论我的时候开始。"

# game/script.rpyc:14146
translate schinese main11_10154d70:

    # MC "Now shut up. I can't hear them over your incessant whispering."
    MC "现在闭嘴。你那喋喋不休的低语声让我听不清他们在说什么。"

# game/script.rpyc:14150
translate schinese main11_29312c92:

    # C "Nghh."
    C "唔……"

# game/script.rpyc:14153
translate schinese main11_8cdb3e4a:

    # s "God, your boobs are so heavy."
    s "天哪，你的胸部好沉啊。"

# game/script.rpyc:14158
translate schinese main11_0a568936:

    # n "I don't think you need to hear any more of this."
    n "我觉得你没必要再听下去了。"

# game/script.rpyc:14159
translate schinese main11_a5b83134:

    # MC "*Tsk*"
    MC "*啧*"

# game/script.rpyc:14163
translate schinese main11_500efa73:

    # n "Hey, [name]?"
    n "嘿，[name]？"

# game/script.rpyc:14164
translate schinese main11_940e8a8c:

    # MC "What is it?"
    MC "什么事？"

# game/script.rpyc:14165
translate schinese main11_511ccb5a:

    # n "Is Stella really not your girlfriend?"
    n "斯特拉真的不是你女朋友吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14166
translate schinese main11_1d2cb162:

    # MC "No. She's not. Why do you ask? Do we look like a couple?"
    MC "不是。怎么这么问？我们看起来像情侣吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14167
translate schinese main11_7a7faeb1:

    # n "It's not that you look like one. It's just how the stars have aligned to give the impression."
    n "倒也不是说看起来像，只是种种迹象让人忍不住这么想。"

# game/script.rpyc:14168
translate schinese main11_8c8d40b7:

    # n "You don't talk to any girls outside of this household. You seem to be getting along with this girl who's around your age. Got her phone number. Convinced her to come over without any fanfare."
    n "你平时除了家里人，根本不跟别的女生来往。可你跟这个同龄女孩却相处得很好——又是要到电话号码，又是能让她这么随随便便地来家里。"

# game/script.rpyc:14169
translate schinese main11_3049ebae:

    # MC "Uh huh. Sorry to get your hopes up."
    MC "嗯……抱歉让你空欢喜一场了。"

# game/script.rpyc:14173
translate schinese main11_3a2ca8d5:

    # n "When are you gonna get a girlfriend, [name]? I don't want you to die alone."
    n "你打算什么时候交女朋友啊，[name]？我可不想看你孤独终老。"

# game/script.rpyc:14174
translate schinese main11_d2839700:

    # MC "Why be so dramatic? How could I die alone if I plan on taking you with me anyway?"
    MC "干嘛说得那么夸张？反正我打算带你一起走，怎么会孤独终老呢？"

# game/script.rpyc:14175
translate schinese main11_63b03d4d:

    # n "Please don't drag me into the same afterlife that permits your entry."
    n "我么请你绝对别拉着我去那个肯收留你的来世。"

# game/script.rpyc:14179
translate schinese main11_f3529942:

    # n "Is she your type?"
    n "她是你的菜吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14180
translate schinese main11_b7bd1b26:

    # MC "Stella?"
    MC "斯特拉？"

