    g "我不明白你当时为什么会在那儿……不过，确实……你当时的处境挺艰难的。换作是我，也不知道该怎么办。"

# game/script.rpyc:14944
translate schinese m11afterchoice_d964da49:

    # g "I can't say I blame you either way. You definitely chose the more difficult of the two options."
    g "不管怎样，我都不会怪你。你确实选择了那两条路里更难走的一条。"

# game/script.rpyc:14945
translate schinese m11afterchoice_0c18bb83:

    # g "You could've just let it go."
    g "你本来大可以撒手不管的。"

# game/script.rpyc:14946
translate schinese m11afterchoice_abdc726c:

    # MC "Didn't cross my mind for a second."
    MC "我压根儿就没想过要那么做。"

# game/script.rpyc:14947
translate schinese m11afterchoice_58035ed7:

    # g "Strange, isn't it? You normally rationalize things way more than that."
    g "真奇怪，不是吗？你平时做事可没这么冲动，总会权衡利弊的。"

# game/script.rpyc:14951
translate schinese m11afterchoice_86d01ab6:

    # g "Hmm..."
    g "嗯……"

# game/script.rpyc:14960
translate schinese m11afterchoice_87ff4251:

    # g "Did your heroic instincts kick in? You trying to impress someone?"
    g "是你的英雄本能作祟吗？你想给谁留下深刻印象？"

# game/script.rpyc:14961
translate schinese m11afterchoice_c634bc70:

    # MC "Let's go with heroic instincts. Why? Have I impressed {i}you{/i}?"
    MC "那就当是英雄本能吧。怎么？我给你留下深刻印象了吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14962
translate schinese m11afterchoice_bb0307f4:

    # g "With your recklessness, you little savior, you."
    g "就凭你的鲁莽劲儿，你这个小救世主。"

# game/script.rpyc:14963
translate schinese m11afterchoice_8cd7e79e:

    # g "I wish I saw it. You sound like a real badass. Though I'm sure you're coloring the story with your own ego."
    g "真希望当时我在场。听起来你当时肯定很威风。不过我敢肯定，你肯定在故事里掺杂了不少个人虚荣心。"

# game/script.rpyc:14964
translate schinese m11afterchoice_9155bca7:

    # g "So what's the plan from now on? It sounds like you've made yourself an enemy. Maybe {i}enemies{/i}."
    g "那接下来有什么打算？听起来你给自己树了个敌人。也许是……好几个{i}敌人{/i}。"

# game/script.rpyc:14965
translate schinese m11afterchoice_0e357cc6:

    # MC "What plan?"
    MC "什么打算？"

# game/script.rpyc:14969
translate schinese m11afterchoice_e9c179de:

    # MC "How exactly am I supposed to plan for anything? I don't even know what's going on."
    MC "我到底该怎么做计划？我连现在是什么情况都搞不清楚。"

# game/script.rpyc:14970
translate schinese m11afterchoice_2da07f6e:

    # g "Maybe we need to look out for ambushes. We've both got pretty good reaction times, haven't we?"
    g "也许我们得提防着点埋伏。咱们俩的反应速度都挺快的，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14971
translate schinese m11afterchoice_f970d3db:

    # MC "You're taking this pretty well, all things considered. This could be serious, you know?"
    MC "考虑到各种情况，你的心态倒是挺好的。要知道，这事儿可能很严重。"

# game/script.rpyc:14972
translate schinese m11afterchoice_f65f5059:

    # g "Hmm. It could be couldn't it?"
    g "嗯。确实有可能，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:14976
translate schinese m11afterchoice_994e6a37:

    # g "You know me. I love the adventure. I never get the opportunity to fight seriously, and I bet we'd make a good team."
    g "你了解我的。我喜欢冒险。我平时可没机会动真格地打一架，而且我敢说，咱们俩肯定能成为好搭档。"

# game/script.rpyc:14978
translate schinese m11afterchoice_5c71c19e:

    # MC "To be precise, I don't exactly know if any fighting is going down in the future."
    MC "确切地说，我也不清楚未来会不会真的发生战斗。"

# game/script.rpyc:14979
translate schinese m11afterchoice_ab4d4d7d:

    # MC "But if I need someone to throw fists with. I would've called you even without you suggesting it."
    MC "但如果真需要找人动手打一架，就算你不提，我也会叫上你的。"

# game/script.rpyc:14980
translate schinese m11afterchoice_ab32003b:

    # g "That's what I like to hear."
    g "这话我爱听。"

# game/script.rpyc:14987
translate schinese m11choice1_1_d0932f08:

    # MC "I dunno, Grace. This could be pretty bad."
    MC "我也不确定，格蕾丝。这事儿可能会很糟糕。"

# game/script.rpyc:14988
translate schinese m11choice1_1_9c96e645:

    # MC "We might have to fight but this isn't some playground shit. We don't know what we're getting involved in. It could be a crime syndicate or something."
    MC "我们或许确实得动手，但这可不是什么小孩子过家家的把戏。我们根本不知道自己卷入了什么——可能是犯罪集团之类的东西。"

# game/script.rpyc:14989
translate schinese m11choice1_1_22d6bacc:

    # MC "Not to mention there's magic involved. I know you can handle yourself, but you can only go so far."
    MC "更别提还涉及魔法了。我知道你有自保能力，但凡事总有限度。"

# game/script.rpyc:14990
translate schinese m11choice1_1_284fa95b:

    # MC "The last thing I want is you getting hurt."
    MC "我最不希望看到的就是你受伤。"

# game/script.rpyc:14994
translate schinese m11choice1_1_6c510334:

    # g "Y-"
    g "你——"

# game/script.rpyc:14996
translate schinese m11choice1_1_ce474d69:

    # g "Yeah..."
    g "对……"

# game/script.rpyc:15002
translate schinese m11choice1_2_07482371:

    # MC "Oh, you know I wouldn't like it if you were any other way."
    MC "噢，你知道的，要是你变成别的样子，我反而不喜欢。"

# game/script.rpyc:15005
translate schinese m11choice1_2_2e7c918d:

    # g "And I'm never gonna change. I'll kick all kinds of ass."
    g "而且我永远不会改变。我会把对手打得落花流水。"

# game/script.rpyc:15006
translate schinese m11choice1_2_8a68319e:

    # MC "What if it's a child?"
    MC "要是对手是个孩子呢？"

# game/script.rpyc:15009
translate schinese m11choice1_2_cf6a79a1:

    # g "Eh... that's a little..."
    g "呃……那有点……"

# game/script.rpyc:15010
translate schinese m11choice1_2_38d84717:

    # MC "Don't worry. I'll handle the children. I think I could take about fifteen at once. See, we do make a good team."
    MC "别担心。孩子就交给我来对付。我想我一次能搞定大约十五个。你看，我们确实是绝佳搭档。"

# game/script.rpyc:15014
translate schinese m11choice1_2_af839d3b:

    # g "Yep, a globetrotting, ass-kicking, slave liberating team."
    g "没错，一个环游世界、痛扁敌人、解放奴隶的搭档组合。"

# game/script.rpyc:15015
translate schinese m11choice1_2_77da893e:

    # MC "Slave liberating? That was a one-time thing. I just wanna stay alive."
    MC "解放奴隶？那只是个例罢了。我只想保住小命。"

# game/script.rpyc:15016
translate schinese m11choice1_2_b0057b60:

    # g "Sure thing, fuck the slave liberating. Let's just stay alive, no matter who I have to dropkick."
    g "没问题，去他妈的解放奴隶吧。咱们只要活下去就行，管他挡路的是谁，直接一脚踹飞。"

# game/script.rpyc:15017
translate schinese m11choice1_2_d723d144:

    # MC "That's the Grace I like to see!"
    MC "这才是我想看到的格蕾丝！"

# game/script.rpyc:15019
translate schinese m11choice1_2_e4dad2b4:

    # g "You're gonna be seeing a whole lot more of this Grace if we're gonna be staying alive together."
    g "既然我们要一起活下去，那你以后还会经常看到这副模样的格蕾丝。"

# game/script.rpyc:15024
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_c6194007:

    # g "By the way, what's this Cadence like?"
    g "对了，那个凯登丝是个什么样的人？"

# game/script.rpyc:15028
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_519a11dc:

    # MC "Massive tits. Like huge badonkers. Noelle-sized. Maybe bigger. She was wearing this button up shirt, and I tell you those buttons were clinging on for dear life."
    MC "胸部超大。简直是巨无霸级别的。跟诺艾尔的尺寸差不多，甚至可能更大。她当时穿着一件扣子衬衫，我跟你说，那些扣子简直是在拼了命地死撑着不崩开。"

# game/script.rpyc:15029
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_4d44be8e:

    # MC "Like seriously. I don't know what her back muscles are made out of! She said she's spent the last five years or so sleeping on a thin mat."
    MC "真的，我都不知道她的背部肌肉到底是什么做的！她说过去这五年左右，她一直睡在一张薄垫子上。"

# game/script.rpyc:15030
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_2fc23c98:

    # MC "Not an ounce of that shows in her posture."
    MC "但她的体态完全看不出受过那种苦。"

# game/script.rpyc:15031
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_e24f7e55:

    # MC "You'd think those gargantuan, fleshy fun-bags would be the straw breaking the proverbial camel's back in this situation."
    MC "按理说，在这种情况下，那对硕大丰满的“肉球”应该早就把她的腰给压垮了才对。"

# game/script.rpyc:15032
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_6c5331c5:

    # MC "But nope. She stands fully vertical without even as much of a grimace."
    MC "但并没有。她完全直立着身子，脸上甚至没有流露出一丝痛苦的表情。"

# game/script.rpyc:15033
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_c57ce092:

    # MC "Now she's got a mattress it's probably the first time she's laid down on her front in forever. It's gotta be like laying on a speed bump."
    MC "如今有了床垫，这恐怕是她许久以来第一次能趴着躺下了。那种感觉，肯定就像趴在减速带上一样。"

# game/script.rpyc:15034
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_69078d2b:

    # MC "Hell, she's probably gonna wake us up whenever she rolls over. Maybe even the whole neighborhood will jolt awake to the thunderous clap of those astronomical milk bazookas slamming together."
    MC "见鬼，她只要一翻身，估计就能把咱们都吵醒。甚至连整个街坊邻居都会被惊醒——毕竟那对硕大无比的“巨型奶炮”撞在一起时，动静简直像打雷一样。"

# game/script.rpyc:15035
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_d18b6b0b:

    # MC "So make sure to be careful when standing behind her. You never know when she'll snap around and fucking concuss you when those wrecking balls slam dunk into your skull."
    MC "所以站在她身后时务必小心。你永远不知道她什么时候会突然转身，那对“巨型铁球”要是狠狠砸在你脑门上，非得把你撞出脑震荡不可。"

# game/script.rpyc:15040
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_12fdfcae:

    # g "I was asking about her personality."
    g "我是问她的性格。"

# game/script.rpyc:15041
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_6b63621a:

    # MC "Her {i}what{/i} now?"
    MC "她的……{i}什么{/i}？"

# game/script.rpyc:15042
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_6f3b7a03:

    # g "Her personality."
    g "她的性格。"

# game/script.rpyc:15043
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_9e467ffa:

    # MC "What's that?"
    MC "那是什么？"

# game/script.rpyc:15044
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_31ccdd9d:

    # g "One of those things you {i}can't{/i} stare at all day."
    g "就是那种你{i}没法{/i}盯着看上一整天的东西。"

# game/script.rpyc:15048
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_797a64bc:

    # MC "Ohh! A {i}{u}personality{/u}{/i}..."
    MC "噢！一个{i}{u}性格{/u}{/i}……"

# game/script.rpyc:15052
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_8fb0a120:

    # MC "Why don't you go find out for yourself? She's literally in the room next to this one."
    MC "你干嘛不自己去了解一下呢？她就在隔壁房间。"

# game/script.rpyc:15053
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_1365b9b4:

    # g "It's late. And I don't wanna put on pants."
    g "太晚了。而且我不想穿裤子。"

# game/script.rpyc:15054
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_2e0e4c6f:

    # MC "You throw your feet up, I'll pull them over your legs... we can work together on this."
    MC "你把脚抬起来，我来帮你把裤腿拉上去……咱们可以一起弄。"

# game/script.rpyc:15058
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_5737312c:

    # g "Some journeys must be faced alone."
    g "有些旅程必须独自面对。"

# game/script.rpyc:15059
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_c9ea230f:

    # MC "You sure? I can hold the waistband elastic to reduce muscular stress. You {i}did{/i} just spend a few hours at the gym."
    MC "你确定？我可以帮你拉住松紧带，减轻肌肉负担。你毕竟刚在健身房练了好几个小时呢。"

# game/script.rpyc:15060
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_cda5ed78:

    # g "And you've spent none. Now tell me which one of us is more qualified to out-strength some elastic?"
    g "而你可是一点都没练。那你告诉我，咱们俩谁更有力气跟那根松紧带较劲？"

# game/script.rpyc:15061
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_b3a8aafb:

    # g "Run along. I've got a friend to make."
    g "去忙你的吧。我得去交个朋友了。"

# game/script.rpyc:15065
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_0f80c12f:

    # MC "Ambitious as ever."
    MC "还是一如既往地有野心啊。"

# game/script.rpyc:15066
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_78e7ac69:

    # MC "Don't start a fight with her over dumbbell etiquette or some shit, okay?"
    MC "别因为什么哑铃使用礼仪之类的破事儿跟她起冲突，好吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:15067
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_2fd00b71:

    # g "Uh huh. Dumbbell etiquette."
    g "嗯哼。哑铃使用礼仪。"

# game/script.rpyc:15068
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_f598d9cd:

    # g "I heard the story. I'll be extra nice to her. My hidden sweet side comes out once every three years. It's time for another awakening."
    g "我听说了那件事。我会对她格外友好的。我那不常显露的温柔一面，每三年才出来一次。现在正好又到了它“觉醒”的时候了。"

# game/script.rpyc:15072
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_74f0ac85:

    # MC "Don't tire yourself out."
    MC "别把自己累坏了。"

# game/script.rpyc:15073
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_e8fdd80c:

    # g "Why not? I usually regain my stamina within twenty-four hours."
    g "为什么不行？我通常二十四小时内就能恢复体力。"

# game/script.rpyc:15074
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_f7b909b7:

    # MC "Right, my bad. I tend to reserve my advice for normal people."
    MC "也是，怪我。我通常只给正常人提建议。"

# game/script.rpyc:15075
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_28c0defc:

    # g "Sorry for not being normal. Now get a move on. I need to go be not normal with the new cat."
    g "抱歉我“不正常”。赶紧走吧，我还要去跟那只新猫一起“不正常”呢。"

# game/script.rpyc:15076
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_e94f5c2f:

    # MC "Yes, yes. Goodnight, Grace. She's real nice and calm, so don't overthink it."
    MC "好好好。晚安，格蕾丝。它性格很好，很温顺，别想太多。"

# game/script.rpyc:15077
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_0adc7630:

    # g "I'll keep that in mind. Night, [name]."
    g "我会记住的。晚安，[name]。"

# game/script.rpyc:15082
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "……"

# game/script.rpyc:15083
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_b4951f99:

    # g "What's wrong? Aren't you leaving?"
    g "怎么了？你不走吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:15084
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_b19f3c75:

    # MC "I can't help but feel like I'm forgetting something..."
    MC "总觉得我好像忘了什么事……"

# game/script.rpyc:15102
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_a7c9a472:

    # msgr "*Sniff*"
    msgr "*吸鼻子*"

# game/script.rpyc:15103
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_aa0c0464:

    # msgr "*Sob*"
    msgr "*抽泣*"

# game/script.rpyc:15116
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_bb2815e3:

    # MC "Eh, it's probably nothing. See ya."
    MC "呃，应该没什么大不了的。回见。"

# game/script.rpyc:15121
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_4b340443:

    # g "..."
    g "……"

# game/script.rpyc:15128
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_99a98f59:

    # gt "Why did he have an erection the whole time?!"
    gt "他怎么全程都勃起着？！"

# game/script.rpyc:15130
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_42138e22:

    # gt "Does that just happen to boys?"
    gt "这是男生常有的事吗？"

# game/script.rpyc:15131
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_daa0dfbb:

    # gt "Or was it because of me?!"
    gt "还是说……是因为我？！"

# game/script.rpyc:15132
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_38843c6f:

    # gt "Should I have mentioned it? Would that have led to something..."
    gt "我当时应该提一下吗？那样会引发什么事吗……"

# game/script.rpyc:15136
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_0f42f3e2:

    # g "Should I have worn pants?"
    g "我是不是该穿条裤子？"

# game/script.rpyc:15163
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_b46caaec:

    # C "M-master?"
    C "主、主人？"

# game/script.rpyc:15168
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_0cf48a02:

    # MC "I want the blowjob!"
    MC "我想做口交！"

# game/script.rpyc:15169
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_295a03fd:

    # MC "I'm sorry... I couldn't stop thinking about it... I know what I said..."
    MC "对不起……我一直忍不住去想这件事……我知道我之前说过什么……"

# game/script.rpyc:15182
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_c634cb8c:

    # C "I said I'd do it if you asked didn't I?"
    C "我说过只要你开口我就愿意做，对吧？"

# game/script.rpyc:15183
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_4f562b2e:

    # C "I'd be happy to do it. It was my idea after all."
    C "我很乐意做。毕竟这本来就是我的主意。"

# game/script.rpyc:15184
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_c209598b:

    # MC "I'm sorry..."
    MC "对不起……"

# game/script.rpyc:15185
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_88500bf4:

    # C "I told you. You risked so much for me. It's a debt I could never repay."
    C "我跟你说过。你为我冒了那么大的险。这份恩情我永远也还不清。"

# game/script.rpyc:15186
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_cabf9189:

    # C "From now on, maybe forever. We're together. Bound by magic."
    C "从今往后，或许直到永远，我们都将在一起。因魔法而紧密相连。"

# game/script.rpyc:15190
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_b605521f:

    # C "I want to be of use to you. I want to serve my master."
    C "我想对您有所助益。我想侍奉我的主人。"

# game/script.rpyc:15191
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_bf1f13cc:

    # C "You need housework done? I'll be there."
    C "需要做家务吗？我会为您效劳。"

# game/script.rpyc:15192
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_7a352654:

    # C "You need company? I'll be there."
    C "需要人陪伴吗？我会陪着你。"

# game/script.rpyc:15193
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_6478843f:

    # C "You need help with something? I'll be there."
    C "需要帮忙吗？我会来帮你。"

# game/script.rpyc:15194
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_30ecc7b6:

    # C "You need someone to fight for you? I'll be there."
    C "你需要有人为你而战吗？我会陪在你身边。"

# game/script.rpyc:15195
translate schinese m11afterchoice1_e75e57a6:

    # C "You need someone to share you burdens? I'll be there."
    C "你需要有人分担重担吗？我会陪在你身边。"

# game/script.rpyc:15196
